"""Project-specific evidence questions and diagnostic cases, authored bilingually."""
P={};B={}
def project(cid,country,lat,lng,scale,year,event,focus,summary,url,publisher):
 P[cid]=dict(country=country,lat=lat,lng=lng,scale=scale,year=year,event=event,focus=focus,summary=summary,url=url,publisher=publisher)
def rows(cid,rows): B[cid]=rows
# Each row is topic, mechanism scenario, evidence test, discriminating diagnosis.
project('hsuehshan','台灣~Taiwan',24.937,121.730,'12.9 km',2006,
'雪山隧道開始小型車通行，之後分階段開放大客車~Hsuehshan Tunnel opens to small vehicles before a later staged opening to coaches',
'破碎帶水壓、長距離探勘與雙孔道路防災~Fault-zone water pressure, long-distance investigation and twin-bore road resilience',
'雪山隧道穿越台灣北部山區，連接北宜高速公路，高公局公開資料列長約12.9公里。本進階課由破碎帶水力連通開始，追蹤開挖、支護及排水的交互作用，再把量測基準和設備資料交給營運端；重點是辨識未知條件如何改變結論，而不重複隧道的入門介紹。~The approximately 12.9 km Hsuehshan Tunnel connects the northern Taiwan expressway with Yilan through mountainous terrain. This advanced course follows fault-zone hydraulic connectivity through excavation, support and drainage, then transfers survey baselines and equipment evidence to operations. Its emphasis is how uncertain conditions change engineering conclusions rather than repeating an introductory description of the tunnel.',
'https://www.freeway.gov.tw/Publish.aspx?cnid=610&p=126','交通部高速公路局~Taiwan Freeway Bureau')
rows('hsuehshan',[
('fault','將雪山山區破碎帶視為多條可能連通水路，研究先進孔揭露的新裂隙如何修正主孔前方預測；不能以已排出的水量推定剩餘岩體必然乾燥。~Treat the mountain fault zone as several potentially connected pathways and examine how a newly intercepted fracture changes the forecast ahead of the main bore. Water already drained does not prove the remaining ground is dry.', '比較同里程先進孔的出水衰減與主孔後續入流，保留孔口壓力及時間基準，檢查兩者是否同受降雨控制。~Compare probe-flow decay with later main-bore inflow at matching chainage, preserving collar pressure and timing to test whether both respond to rainfall.', '若抽水後短暫衰減被誤判為水源耗盡，進入另一連通裂隙時水量可能回升；應用壓力回復試驗區分補注。~A temporary decline mistaken for exhaustion can be followed by renewed inflow from another fracture; pressure recovery helps distinguish recharge.'),
('water','以雪山兩孔及探勘坑之間的水頭差建立假想分層模型，分辨局部排水效果與整座山體地下水位下降；永久襯砌還要承受排水失效狀態。~Build a hypothetical layered head model between the two bores and exploratory gallery, separating local drainage from regional drawdown. Permanent lining must also be assessed when the drainage path is unavailable.', '把各孔測壓管高程校至同一基準，分開穩態水位、降雨尖峰與停泵回升；讀值低於洞頂時仍檢查其他含水層。~Level piezometers to one datum and separate steady head, rainfall peaks and outage recovery; low readings in one layer do not exclude pressure elsewhere.', '一孔排水可能讓另一孔水位同步變化，若當作兩次獨立事件會誤估滲透性；需先查共同補注和管路連通。~Drainage in one bore may alter the other; treating these as independent events biases permeability estimates, so investigate shared recharge and connections.'),
('stress','將雪山覆土與破碎帶交界分開，檢查高應力岩塊旁的低剛度帶是否使洞壁變形集中；覆土相近的兩個斷面不一定採相同材料模型。~Separate cover effects from the fault transition and examine whether a compliant band beside stressed blocks concentrates wall movement. Two sections with similar cover need not share the same constitutive model.', '在岩塊與破碎帶兩側設多點伸長計，將破壞方位、開挖距離和支護受力同步比較，以辨認彈性回彈或持續塑性變形。~Compare extensometers on both sides with damage orientation, face distance and support force to distinguish elastic rebound from continuing plastic deformation.', '若只按平均岩級分段，局部剝落與擠壓可被混為同一機制，導致支護剛度增加卻無法容納位移。~Averaged ground classes can confuse spalling with squeezing, increasing stiffness without providing the needed displacement capacity.'),
('support','以雪山長隧道施工的支護封閉時序為題，分析掌子面前進後尚未形成閉合環的暫時狀態；開挖面距離與支護齡期要與最終尺寸同時保留。~Study the temporary condition before support closes into a ring as the heading advances. Face distance and support age must remain visible alongside final dimensions when interpreting loads and convergence.', '將每次封閉時間標在收斂曲線，檢查速率改變是否發生於同一施工事件，再比較支護荷重是否有對應反應。~Mark each closure time on convergence histories and test whether rate changes coincide with construction events and corresponding support-load changes.', '位移趨緩可能只是量測點移出活躍區，若未記錄掌子面位置會過早認定整段已穩定。~Slower movement may mean the point has left the active zone; without face position it can be misread as stability of the whole section.'),
('tbm','雪山案例用來比較受地質限制的掘進循環：刀具切削時間、檢查修理及出渣等待必須分開，才能判定設備瓶頸或破碎帶風險誰先控制進度。~Use the Hsuehshan context to separate cutting, inspection and spoil queues in a geologically constrained cycle, determining whether machinery or fault-zone uncertainty controls progress before proposing a production change.', '把停機原因碼對齊刀具檢查和地質里程，另以完整班次的時間收支核對日報，避免只選高產時段評估機器。~Align downtime causes with cutter inspection and geological chainage, checking a complete shift time balance rather than selecting high-output intervals.', '出渣等待若被列為地質停工，會把後勤問題誤判成岩石太硬，導致無效更換刀具或修改推進策略。~Spoil queues classified as ground delay falsely suggest hard rock and prompt ineffective cutter replacement or advance changes.'),
('logistics','雪山山區工址的長距離運輸使裝載、交會與卸料相互制約，假想多工作面同時出渣時需檢查共同通道容量，不能只按各面最佳日進尺配置車隊。~Long access distances couple loading, passing and unloading. For simultaneous hypothetical headings, test the shared route against combined demand rather than sizing fleets from each face best daily advance.', '按車次配對裝載重量和到卸料點時間，找出排隊集中區；比較維修期間與正常時段的有效循環。~Pair payloads with arrival times at unloading, locate queue concentration and compare effective cycles during maintenance and ordinary service.', '增加車輛若堵住單線交會點，總運量反而下降，且材料補給可能與撤離需求競爭同一空間。~More vehicles can block passing locations and reduce throughput while material deliveries compete with evacuation access.'),
('survey','雪山長距離貫通的教學情境著重方向傳遞：將洞口地表基準、導坑及主孔控制網分開覆核，找出共用基準偏差無法靠重複量測自行消除的原因。~For long-distance breakthrough, independently examine surface control, pilot-gallery transfer and the main-bore network. Identify why repeated measurements cannot remove a bias inherited from a shared starting datum.', '從另一地表控制線重新傳遞方向，對照不同溫度時段的角距原始值，再把閉合差拆成水平與高程分量。~Transfer orientation from another surface control route, compare raw observations across temperature periods and separate horizontal and vertical closure components.', '若把導坑成果當絕對真值，主孔與導坑可以共同偏離正確方向，兩者彼此吻合仍會錯過預定貫通位置。~Treating pilot control as exact can make both networks agree while both deviate from the intended breakthrough point.'),
('ventilation','以雪山雙孔道路的一孔維修為情境，分析風門、橫通道及車流邊界如何共同改變網路；不能把施工通風模型直接移作營運控煙模型。~Use maintenance in one road bore to examine changes in dampers, passages and traffic boundaries. Construction ventilation cannot be transferred directly into an operational smoke-control model with different occupants and sources.', '同步記錄兩孔風速、壓差與門位，先比正常工況再比核准異常工況，辨認風量減少來自漏風還是阻力增加。~Synchronise both-bore flow, pressure and door states, comparing normal and approved degraded cases to distinguish leakage from increased resistance.', '橫通道門位資料若過期，模型可能預測隔離但現場形成短路風流，關鍵區段抽排效果便被高估。~Outdated passage-door states may predict isolation while a real airflow shortcut reduces extraction in the critical zone.'),
('drain','雪山排水教學把斷層入流和機電故障合併：若雨後淨入流提高同時一台泵維修，剩餘容積與警報延遲要放在同一時間線，不把名義備援當保證。~Combine fault inflow and equipment state: after rainfall, increased net inflow can coincide with pump maintenance. Place usable volume and alarm delay on one timeline rather than treating nominal redundancy as guaranteed service.', '用實測集水坑水位容積曲線核對流量，再將維修隔離狀態和警報傳輸延遲加入緩衝計算，確認淤積已扣除。~Check flow against the measured sump curve, then include isolated equipment and alarm-transmission delay in the buffer calculation with sediment deducted.', '若雨後水量超過平日平均而沿用舊緩衝時間，故障處理可能尚未完成水位已達設備區，形成連鎖失效。~Using an ordinary-day buffer after rainfall can let water reach equipment before recovery is complete, producing cascading failure.'),
('asset','雪山營運交接以排水及通風共同介面為核心，要求一項告警能追到設備位置、供電來源和最後校正；改名或設備更換不能切斷原始趨勢。~Handover focuses on drainage-ventilation interfaces: each alarm must trace to location, supply and last calibration. Renaming or replacement must preserve the ability to interpret historical trends and distinguish renewal from deterioration.', '抽查低點水位告警與風機故障各一例，從控制畫面找到工單及現場標籤，重算設備更換前後是否可直接比較。~Sample a low-point alarm and fan fault from screen to work order and physical tag, testing comparability across equipment replacement.', '若新水位計沿用舊零點卻換了安裝高程，趨勢可能顯示假的水量增加；先核對基準而非立刻擴泵。~A replacement level sensor at a new elevation with an old zero creates false rising-water trends; check datum before increasing pumping.')])
project('b102','英國與法國~United Kingdom and France',51.096,1.147,'50 km',1994,
'英法海底隧道開放，建立海峽兩岸固定鐵路連結~The Channel Tunnel opens as a fixed railway connection across the Channel',
'主孔服務孔介面、壓力波與長期可維護性~Running-bore and service-gallery interfaces, pressure waves and maintainability',
'英法海底隧道讓客貨列車與車輛接駁列車通過英吉利海峽，營運商列長約50公里並記錄1994年啟用。本進階課把海底水壓、襯砌接縫、熱量、氣動擾動與維修可用率連成同一系統，特別比較主孔與服務通道的任務差異，避免把各設備單獨合格當整體服務可靠。~The approximately 50 km Channel Tunnel carries passenger, freight and vehicle-shuttle trains beneath the English Channel and opened in 1994. This advanced course links subsea pressure, lining joints, heat, aerodynamic disturbances and maintenance availability. It distinguishes the duties of running bores and service access, showing why individual equipment compliance does not by itself establish a reliable operating system.',
'https://press.getlinkgroup.com/news/1994-2024-the-channel-tunnel-30-years-of-unique-history-d776-0791e.html','Getlink營運集團~Getlink')
rows('b102',[
('water','英法海底案例先區分海面水深與岩層測壓水頭，避免把海床幾何直接當襯砌各處水壓；服務通道排水也會影響局部梯度。~Distinguish seawater depth from rock piezometric head, including local gradients affected by service-gallery drainage rather than equating seabed geometry with pressure everywhere.', '將主孔與服務孔測壓點用同一高程和潮位基準比較，檢查水頭相位差是否支持連通假設。~Compare bore and service-gallery piezometers on one elevation and tide datum, testing whether phase differences support hydraulic connectivity.', '潮汐反應滯後若當成儀器故障，會錯過含水層傳遞時間與排水邊界變化。~Mistaking tidal lag for sensor failure loses information about aquifer response time and drainage-boundary changes.'),
('lining','比較英法主孔及服務通道的襯砌尺度，幾何縮小雖改變膜應力量級，接頭轉角、局部荷載及維修開口仍須獨立評估。~Compare lining scales in running bores and service access; geometric scaling changes membrane stress but does not preserve joint rotations, local loads or maintenance-opening behaviour.', '分別建立兩種斷面的接頭模型，將同水頭下環向變形與開口附近局部應變對照。~Model both jointed sections separately and compare circumferential movement with local strains near openings under matched head.', '把小孔的接縫性能按比例套到大孔，可能忽略更大的絕對張開和局部偏心。~Scaling small-bore sealing performance to the larger bore can miss increased absolute opening and local eccentricity.'),
('seal','服務通道與主孔間的連接令止水介面不只沿圓環分布，教學比較規則接縫和分岔部位的變形相容，不能只按平均寬度分類。~Connections between service access and running bores create nonuniform interfaces; compare regular joints with branch movement compatibility rather than classifying seals by mean gap alone.', '在接縫轉角及分岔附近保存錯台方向，選全尺寸測試中真正對應的組合，而非只比水壓。~Retain offset direction at rotated and branched interfaces and select the matching full-size test combination, not pressure alone.', '不同方向錯台可能讓密封接觸區遷移，單一正向試驗合格不能證明反向循環後仍水密。~Opposite offsets can shift the sealing contact zone; passing one-direction tests does not prove tightness after reversed cycles.'),
('logistics','長海底隧道的維修物流需在列車服務與服務通道使用間協調，備料的距離和返回時間會影響實際工作窗口，不只看工具進入時間。~Maintenance logistics must fit railway service and service-access use; material distance and return time constrain the window beyond the time needed to bring tools inside.', '用工單時間戳分開進入、作業、清點及撤出，核對共用路線是否在同一窗口被另一任務占用。~Separate access, work, inventory checks and withdrawal in work-order timestamps and identify overlapping use of shared routes.', '只安排作業時間而不留撤出驗證，會把未清空的工作面錯報成可恢復列車服務。~Scheduling work without verified withdrawal time can incorrectly report an occupied worksite as ready for railway service.'),
('cooling','英法列車與設備熱源會隨服務密度改變，分析正常高峰和一條冷卻路徑維修時的空氣及水側熱帳，避免把裝置容量直接視為可移除熱量。~Traffic-dependent heat must be reconciled across air and water during peaks and cooling-path maintenance rather than equating installed capacity with removable heat.', '配對列車通過時段、設備功率、進出口溫差和流量，檢查熱量殘差是否集中在服務高峰。~Pair train passages, equipment power, temperature rise and flow, checking whether energy residuals cluster during peak service.', '平均日溫度正常可能遮住列車連續通過的局部熱峰，需保留時間解析度再判斷冷卻不足。~A normal daily mean can conceal local peaks during successive train passages; retain time resolution before judging cooling adequacy.'),
('wave','英法主孔的列車種類與速度不同，阻塞比和交會情境應分案；服務通道門位又會改變壓力反射邊界，不能用單一動壓替代波動歷程。~Different train types, speeds and encounter cases change blockage and wave behaviour; service-access door states also alter reflections beyond a single dynamic-pressure estimate.', '在列車通過前後同步量測門兩側壓力，將列車編組與門位一起保存，檢查反射峰抵達時間。~Synchronise pressure across doors before and after passage, retaining formation and door state to check reflected-wave arrival.', '只存最大壓力不存升壓時間，可能漏掉設備密封與乘客感受所受的快速變化。~Saving only peak pressure loses rapid changes relevant to seals and passenger comfort.'),
('escape','英法服務通道提供不同於運行孔的接收空間，疏散模型需確認到達之後的人流容量與可用狀態，不能在越過第一道門時就結束計時。~Service access provides a receiving space distinct from the running bore; evacuation modelling must include capacity and availability after the first doorway, not stop its clock there.', '演練或模擬分開通過橫通道門與後續移動時間，核對接收區人數及通訊延遲。~Separate doorway crossing from onward movement in drills or models, checking receiving-zone occupancy and communication delays.', '通道本身可用但接收區壅塞時，隊列會回堵主孔，使用單一平均步速會低估所需時間。~Congestion in an otherwise accessible receiving zone can queue people back into the running bore and defeat an average-speed estimate.'),
('drain','海底排水的可靠性需連結低點集水、供電與維修隔離，假想兩台泵中一台退出時，分析淨入流與警報延遲而不把原容量沿用。~Link low-point sumps, power and maintenance isolation; when one hypothetical pump is unavailable, recalculate net inflow and alarm delay rather than retaining the original capacity.', '將水位上升曲線與當時泵啟停、閥位及出水流量同步，區分閥路阻塞和機械輸出不足。~Synchronise level rise with pump state, valves and discharge, distinguishing blocked routing from deficient mechanical output.', '名義備泵若共用堵塞出口，切換成功但水位仍升；應查管路而非反覆切換泵。~A spare sharing a blocked outlet can transfer successfully while water keeps rising; diagnose the route instead of repeatedly switching pumps.'),
('reliability','英法跨境服務把電力、控制、冷卻與維修責任放在多個介面，設備重複不能消除共用軟體或配電故障，需以功能可用性定義頂事件。~Cross-border service couples power, controls, cooling and maintenance responsibilities; duplicated equipment does not eliminate shared software or distribution faults, so define top events by lost function.', '從一項失去服務的事件反向追到共用電源和控制版本，再比對維修時設備是否真的獨立。~Trace one loss-of-service event back to common supply and control revisions and test independence during maintenance.', '把同一次共同電源故障拆成兩個獨立事件會嚴重低估並聯不可用率，且掩蓋責任介面。~Splitting one common-supply fault into independent events understates parallel unavailability and hides interface responsibility.'),
('asset','英法長期營運需要把更新設備與原設施共同管理，資料交接必須保留新舊版本適用里程及日期，不能讓歷史趨勢因供應商更換而中斷。~Long-term renewal requires old and new systems to coexist in records, with chainage and dates defining each revision rather than losing historical trends when suppliers change.', '抽查更換過的感測器，從現行標籤追到舊型號校正與工單，驗證量程和零點是否可比。~Sample a replaced sensor from its current tag back to previous calibration and work orders, checking range and zero comparability.', '設備ID重用但未保留更換日期，會把新感測器的偏移解讀成隧道結構突然改變。~Reusing an asset ID without replacement dates can turn a new-sensor offset into a false sudden structural change.')])
project('b103','瑞士~Switzerland',46.850,8.634,'57 km',2016,
'哥達基線隧道投入營運，成為瑞士平緩跨阿爾卑斯鐵路核心~Gotthard Base Tunnel enters service as a core of the Swiss low-gradient transalpine railway',
'深覆土地應力、基線牽引與多工作面整合~Deep-cover stress, base-railway traction and multiple-heading integration',
'哥達基線隧道長57公里，瑞士官方記錄2016年投入營運，服務平緩跨阿爾卑斯鐵路。本進階課由牽引效益及覆土應力出發，連接支護時序、襯砌接頭、多工作面物流及精密貫通；最後比較岩體熱與列車壓力擾動，說明土建完成仍須完成系統介面驗證。~The 57 km Gotthard Base Tunnel entered service in 2016 as part of Switzerland’s low-gradient transalpine railway. This advanced course connects traction benefits and cover stress to support timing, lining joints, multiple-heading logistics and precision breakthrough. It then compares rock heat and train pressure disturbances, explaining why civil completion still requires verification of operating-system interfaces.',
'https://www.uvek.admin.ch/en/nrla','瑞士聯邦交通能源環境部~Swiss DETEC')
rows('b103',[
('rail','哥達基線的低坡度目標必須和重載列車情境一起評估，減少坡度阻力不表示通風氣動與加速功率可忽略。~Assess Gotthard’s low-gradient purpose with heavy-train scenarios; reduced gravity resistance does not eliminate aerodynamic, acceleration or ventilation demands.', '將同一列車在基線與假想山線上的逐段坡度功率比較，再分開制動和牽引需求。~Compare local grade power for one train on base and hypothetical mountain alignments, separating braking from traction.', '若只比較最高坡度而忽略長度和速度歷程，節能結論可能偏離整段旅程。~Comparing maximum grade without length and speed history can misstate whole-journey energy benefit.'),
('stress','哥達深覆土的教學模型先分開遠場應力與洞壁集中，研究同一覆土下不同水平應力比對破壞方向的影響。~Separate remote stress from wall concentration in deep cover and examine how different horizontal stress ratios change damage orientation at the same depth.', '把洞壁破壞方位與原位應力及節理方向比對，測試各模型是否預測同一高需求區。~Compare wall-damage orientation with stress and joints, testing whether alternative models predict the same critical zone.', '以覆土唯一決定應力會錯估側壁或拱頂哪處先受損，進而誤置觀測點。~Using cover alone can misidentify whether walls or crown govern and place monitoring at the wrong location.'),
('support','哥達多地質區段的支護不能只以最終厚度比較，需把安裝距離和可容許變形納入，理解何時剛性過高反而增加局部需求。~Compare support across ground domains using activation distance and deformation allowance, not final thickness alone, and identify when excess stiffness increases local demand.', '按掌子面距離重排收斂與荷重資料，檢查不同區段能否用同一支護曲線解釋。~Replot convergence and load against face distance, testing whether one support curve explains different sections.', '把不同安裝時點的讀值混合會誤判材料剛度，可能把施工順序問題當材料缺陷。~Mixing activation times biases inferred stiffness and can misclassify a sequence problem as a material defect.'),
('lining','長基線隧道的襯砌須接收地盤、水壓及施工頂推等不同作用，哥達情境比較均勻外壓估算與接頭局部彎曲，避免只用厚度判斷可靠性。~For the long base-tunnel context, compare uniform-pressure lining estimates with local joint bending under ground, water and construction actions rather than judging reliability by thickness alone.', '量測環向變形及接縫開口，將背填和水頭回升階段分開，再對照接頭剛度敏感度。~Measure ring distortion and joint gaps by grouting and head-recovery stage, comparing joint-stiffness sensitivity.', '相同平均應變可能掩蓋一處接縫轉動集中，局部防水需求會比整環平均更不利。~Identical mean strain can hide concentrated rotation at one joint with worse local sealing demand.'),
('tbm','哥達施工循環可用來分離切削速率與多工作面的有效利用率，並追問刀具維修時間是否隨地質而改變，不能用最佳單班外推整段工期。~Separate cutting rate from multi-heading utilisation and test whether cutter maintenance changes with geology; a best shift cannot be extrapolated to the whole drive.', '以完整停時分類配對地質及刀具檢查，另用班次時間閉合檢查有無重複計時。~Pair downtime classes with geology and cutter inspections, closing shift time to detect double-counting.', '把換刀和出渣重疊時間加兩次會低估利用率，錯誤地支持增購機械的決策。~Double-counting overlapping cutter and spoil delays understates utilisation and can falsely justify more machinery.'),
('logistics','哥達多工作面共用後勤的教學重點是串聯瓶頸，豎井、連絡通道和卸料區的能力不能在不同時間假設下相加。~The multiple-heading context highlights serial logistics bottlenecks: shafts, connecting galleries and unloading areas cannot be combined using inconsistent time assumptions.', '對同一日逐小時建立材料和出渣需求表，核對維修時段是否同步占用共用運輸節點。~Build hourly material and spoil demand for the same day and identify maintenance overlap at shared transport nodes.', '各面個別達成計畫但共同卸料區壅塞時，整體進度仍可能失守，應由網路而非單面診斷。~Faces may meet local plans while shared unloading congestion defeats overall progress, requiring a network-level diagnosis.'),
('survey','哥達長距離貫通要區分方向傳遞、尺度及高程三類誤差，地下兩組控制網即使互相閉合，也可能共用同一錯誤地表基準。~Distinguish orientation, scale and elevation errors over long breakthrough distances; two underground networks can close while sharing a wrong surface datum.', '獨立重算地表至各工作面的轉換，對照原始角距和不同環境條件量測，保留誤差相關性。~Independently recompute transformations to each heading using raw observations under different conditions, retaining error correlations.', '只報一個三維閉合量會掩蓋高程方向的系統偏差，使軌道銜接問題延後暴露。~One three-dimensional closure magnitude can hide a systematic height bias until track connection.'),
('cooling','哥達深部岩體放熱與列車或施工機械熱源時間尺度不同，需比較穩態空氣熱帳與長期岩體溫度演化，避免把短時試驗當全年能力。~Deep-rock heat evolves on a different timescale from trains or machinery; compare air balances with longer rock-temperature evolution rather than treating short trials as year-round capability.', '將岩壁溫度、風量及機械負載分別保存，檢查停工降溫是否真的代表岩體熱源已消失。~Retain wall temperature, airflow and machine load separately and test whether shutdown cooling truly indicates reduced rock heat.', '停機後空氣迅速降溫但岩體仍持續放熱，重新載入時可能很快回到高溫，需辨認熱儲存。~Air cools quickly after shutdown while rock retains heat, so renewed loading can rapidly restore high temperatures.'),
('wave','哥達高速鐵路的氣動檢核需配對列車編組、速度及隧道斷面，對向交會與門位改變會產生不同壓力歷程，不能只看動壓比例。~Pair formation, speed and cross-section for aerodynamic assessment; encounters and door states produce different pressure histories beyond simple dynamic-pressure scaling.', '在不同里程同步記錄壓力波抵達時間，以傳播時間和反射時刻檢查模型邊界，而非只擬合峰值。~Record wave arrival at multiple chainages and use propagation and reflection timing to test boundaries rather than fitting peaks alone.', '錯誤邊界可能碰巧擬合最大值卻錯估升壓速率，設備承受的循環需求仍會不正確。~An incorrect boundary may match the peak accidentally while misrepresenting rise rate and cyclic equipment demand.'),
('asset','哥達交付從多個施工面整併成一個鐵路資產系統，需把不同承包界面、材料批次及試運轉版本連到同一里程，避免資料在土建與機電間斷裂。~Integrate multiple construction fronts into one railway asset system, linking contract interfaces, batches and commissioning revisions to chainage so civil and systems evidence remain connected.', '抽查一段軌道附近設備，將竣工位置、供電路徑和控制版本追至對應施工及試驗紀錄。~Sample equipment near one track section and trace position, supply and control revision to construction and commissioning records.', '各標段檔案各自完整但里程原點不同，會讓相鄰設備對不上圖面，維修隔離可能定位錯誤。~Complete contract files with inconsistent chainage origins can mislocate adjacent assets and maintenance isolation.')])
def packed(cid,text):
 rows(cid,[tuple(x.strip() for x in line.split('|')) for line in text.strip().splitlines() if line.strip()])
project('b104','瑞士~Switzerland',46.574,7.663,'approximately 35 km',2007,'勒奇山基線隧道投入營運，部分第二孔仍待擴充~Lotschberg Base Tunnel enters service with portions of the second bore awaiting expansion','分期雙孔、混合交通容量與營運中擴建~Staged twin bores, mixed-traffic capacity and expansion beside operations','勒奇山案例的核心不是單純延長隧道，而是已營運路線如何面對分期建造留下的容量與介面限制。BLS公開資料將其描述為約35公里的基線隧道；本課把未裝設段、單線衝突、維修窗口、出水與施工隔離分開，逐步建立可供營運和擴建共同審查的證據鏈。~The Lotschberg case concerns the capacity and interfaces left by staged construction rather than length alone. BLS describes an approximately 35 km base tunnel. This course separates unfinished bore sections, single-track conflicts, maintenance windows, water conditions and construction isolation, building an evidence chain that operations and expansion teams can review together.','https://www.bls.ch/en/unternehmen/projekte-und-hintergruende/neat','BLS 鐵路公司~BLS railway company')
packed('b104', '''route|比較勒奇山已營運段與擴建段的共同端點，將未裝軌洞體與不存在的洞段分開，避免把土建完成當交通容量。~Compare common endpoints across operating and expansion sections, distinguishing an unfitted bore from an unexcavated section before assigning transport capacity.|用營運配置圖與工程分區核對每段可通行狀態。~Reconcile operating diagrams and works sections to identify the usable status of each segment.|只有洞體未裝軌的段落若算入容量，會虛構列車交會點。~Counting an unfitted bore creates fictitious train-passing opportunities.
headway|以勒奇山單線與雙線相接為情境，將對向列車等待和清空時間分開，辨認貨客混行的容量限制。~At a single-to-double-track transition, separate opposing-train waiting from clearance time and identify the constraints imposed by mixed passenger and freight traffic.|重播一個尖峰時段的占用紀錄，加入一列晚到貨車。~Replay one peak-period occupancy record with a delayed freight train added.|只算單向班距會漏掉對向衝突，使時刻表名目容量無法實現。~One-direction headways omit opposing conflicts and overstate timetable capacity.
rail|比較基線路線的低坡度與列車質量，將坡度功率和站外加速需求分開，避免把省能全歸於隧道長度。~Compare low-gradient alignment and train mass, separating grade power from approach acceleration rather than attributing all energy benefit to tunnel length.|核對縱斷面坡度符號、列車質量和同速區段的功率。~Check gradient sign, train mass and power over equal-speed sections.|下坡回生未計效率時可能被當作全部可回收能量。~Ignoring regenerative efficiency can overstate recoverable downhill energy.
water|勒奇山擴建的教學模型保留營運孔排水與新開挖孔之間的水力連通，檢查新排水是否改變既有孔外壓。~Retain hydraulic connectivity between the operating bore and a hypothetical new heading, testing whether new drainage changes pressure around the existing bore.|配對兩孔水頭與出流歷線，標示新孔施工事件。~Pair both-bore heads and flows against new-heading construction events.|共同水頭下降不應被誤判為兩套排水設備同時改善。~Shared drawdown should not be mistaken for independent improvement of both drainage systems.
support|在未完成洞段重新進場的情境中，分析舊支護齡期、暴露環境與新開挖釋放的疊加，不直接沿用原施工期參數。~For re-entry to an unfinished section, examine aged support, exposure and renewed excavation release rather than reusing original construction parameters unchanged.|將舊裂縫圖與新收斂基線配對，區分既有和新增變形。~Pair legacy crack maps with a new convergence baseline to distinguish old and new movement.|把舊裂縫全部視為新施工所致會誤導支護判讀。~Attributing all old cracks to new works misdirects support interpretation.
logistics|營運旁擴建需要共用入口時，列車、材料與維修人員各自占用時間，不能假設夜間窗口全供出渣。~When expansion shares access with operations, trains, materials and maintainers each occupy time; a night window is not entirely available for spoil transport.|將保護設置和恢復營運時間從窗口中明確扣除。~Explicitly deduct protection setup and restoration time from each access window.|忽略恢復檢查會使最後一車出渣與首班營運列車衝突。~Omitted restoration checks create conflict between the final spoil movement and first service.
survey|擴建需接回既有軌道控制網，研究新舊坐標、溫度和軌道維修基準不一致所造成的累積偏差。~Expansion must reconnect with existing track control, so examine bias from differing coordinate revisions, temperatures and maintenance reference systems.|以獨立控制線核對新舊網的尺度及高程轉換。~Independently verify scale and height transformations between old and new networks.|只比坐標數字而未比版本可能把基準移動當結構位移。~Comparing coordinates without revisions confuses datum change with structural movement.
ventilation|以施工區與營運區隔離為題，分析門位及施工風管改變時兩區壓差，保留營運事故模式的獨立需求。~Study pressure differences across construction-operational isolation as doors and temporary ducts change, retaining the separate requirements of operational incident modes.|在核准隔離狀態下比對施工側風量與營運側壓差。~Compare construction airflow and operational pressure under approved isolation states.|施工排風若短路到營運區，兩側感測器可能各自顯示正常局部風速。~A construction-air shortcut may coexist with apparently normal local velocities on both sides.
escape|分期工程的避難路徑可能穿越暫時封閉區域，建立依施工階段變動的路線圖，不能只保留最終完工配置。~Staged works can temporarily close an escape route; maintain stage-specific access maps rather than relying only on the final completed arrangement.|走查每個施工階段的門位、可通行淨寬和資訊標示。~Walk each stage to check door state, usable width and signs.|舊版逃生圖若仍指向施工封閉段，距離計算再精確也無效。~An obsolete map leading into a closed works zone invalidates precise distance calculations.
asset|擴建介面需把舊設備識別碼、控制位址與新竣工資料連結，檢查維修系統是否能辨認同名不同孔設備。~Link legacy identifiers and control addresses to expansion records, testing whether maintenance systems distinguish similarly named assets in different bores.|抽樣由現場標籤追到圖紙、控制點及檢修紀錄。~Sample the trace from field label to drawing, control point and maintenance record.|重複識別碼會把故障回報派到錯誤孔別，完整表格也可能內容錯配。~Duplicate identifiers send fault responses to the wrong bore despite apparently complete records.''')
project('b105','瑞士~Switzerland',46.170,8.929,'15.4 km',2020,'切內里基線隧道完成並於年底全面營運~Ceneri Base Tunnel is completed and enters full operation at year end','基線路線、雙孔軌道與系統整合~Base alignment, twin-bore track and system integration','切內里是瑞士新阿爾卑斯鐵路線的南段關鍵，官方資料列長15.4公里並於2020年底全面營運。本課由縱坡與列車需求出發，連接施工物流、軌道基準、隧道氣動和設備交付；學員須解釋土建完成之後仍有哪些測試才能支持完整鐵路服務。~Ceneri is a southern link of the Swiss new transalpine railway, officially described as 15.4 km and fully operational at the end of 2020. Starting with gradient and train demand, this course connects construction logistics, track reference systems, tunnel aerodynamics and equipment handover to the evidence needed beyond civil completion.','https://www.uvek.admin.ch/en/nrla','瑞士聯邦環境交通能源通訊部~Swiss DETEC')
packed('b105','''route|將切內里基線孔與兩端接線分開，研究站間時間與隧道內行程不是同一計量邊界。~Separate the base bore from its approaches and distinguish station-to-station time from travel within the tunnel.|比較相同端點的路線和停站假設，保留接線速度限制。~Compare equal endpoints and stopping assumptions while retaining approach speed restrictions.|忽略站外接線會把隧道理論節時當成全線實際節時。~Omitting approaches equates theoretical tunnel savings with whole-route savings.
rail|以切內里低坡度路線連接區域與長途列車為題，分析相同坡度對不同質量列車的牽引需求。~Use the low-gradient link to compare traction demand for regional and long-distance trains with different masses.|以同速同坡條件重算各列車質量的坡度分量。~Recalculate the grade component for each mass at equal speed and slope.|以空車質量估滿載運轉會低估坡度阻力，尤其混編比較。~Using empty mass understates grade resistance in loaded and mixed formations.
fault|切內里山區教學剖面保留節理方向改變，分析同岩性不同構造如何影響掌子面穩定與探查布置。~Retain changing joint orientation in a teaching section, examining how structure changes face behaviour even within the same rock type.|按方位而非只按岩名整理揭露資料，核對探孔代表性。~Organise exposures by orientation as well as lithology and check probe representativeness.|同岩名即採同支護會漏掉新形成的可動節理塊體。~Assigning support by rock name alone misses newly removable joint blocks.
tbm|比較切內里背景下的假想連續切削與循環開挖績效，將施工方法假設和正式工程史分開。~Compare hypothetical continuous cutting and cyclic excavation in the Ceneri setting, clearly separating teaching methods from documented construction history.|對兩個假想班次使用相同總工時與完整停時分類。~Use equal total shift time and complete downtime classes for both hypothetical shifts.|只以最快切削分鐘比較兩方法會誤判整班生產能力。~Comparing only the fastest cutting minutes misjudges whole-shift production.
logistics|雙孔設備安裝同時進行時，軌道板、電纜與通風材料共用運輸通道，研究施工隊介面造成的等待。~During simultaneous twin-bore installation, track components, cables and ventilation materials share access and create inter-team queues.|按材料類別比較到場、卸載和實際安裝時間。~Compare arrival, unloading and installation times by material class.|材料到場被列為完成安裝會高估可用工作面和剩餘窗口。~Treating delivery as installation completion overstates available work fronts and remaining time.
survey|軌道與接觸網在切內里長孔內需共享幾何基準，分析土建控制點與軌道調整坐標之間的轉換。~Track and overhead systems need a shared geometric reference; examine transformations from civil control to adjusted railway coordinates.|獨立核對軌頂高程、中心線和接觸網定位的版本。~Independently reconcile rail elevation, centreline and overhead positioning revisions.|不同基準各自閉合仍可能使設備淨空在介面處不足。~Individually closed networks can still create inadequate interface clearance if their references differ.
wave|列車進出切內里孔口的壓力變化用來辨認氣動尺度，將動壓估算與實際壓力波幅及乘坐舒適分開。~Use entry and exit pressure changes to distinguish dynamic-pressure scale from actual wave amplitude and passenger comfort.|同步對齊列車速度、位置和不同距離壓力訊號。~Synchronise train speed, position and pressure signals at several distances.|把動壓直接當洞口壓力波會忽略阻塞比與反射。~Equating dynamic pressure with portal waves omits blockage and reflection.
escape|雙孔鐵路的撤離先要辨認事故孔與安全孔狀態，行走距離只是通行能力和資訊延遲的一部分。~Twin-bore railway evacuation first identifies incident and safe-bore states; walking distance is only part of accessibility and information delay.|演練資料分列通知、下車、集結和步行階段。~Separate notification, detraining, assembly and walking in exercise records.|忽略下車階段會使僅按步速的撤離時間過度樂觀。~Omitting detraining makes a walking-speed-only evacuation estimate optimistic.
reliability|切內里系統交付情境中，兩組供電或控制設備若共用冷卻與通訊，須分開分析表面冗餘和共同故障。~For system handover, distinguish nominal redundancy from shared cooling and communications that can disable both power or control paths.|沿供電及通訊拓樸逐點追查共用設備和切換紀錄。~Trace shared equipment and transfer records along power and communications topology.|兩套主機同置一個失效環境不符合獨立失效率乘積假設。~Two units exposed to one failing environment violate the independent-failure product assumption.
asset|鐵路通車需要土建、軌道、供電和控制的測試證據連結，研究切內里背景下的設備交付缺口。~Railway commissioning needs linked civil, track, power and control test evidence; examine gaps in a Ceneri-style handover.|從一個警報追到現場設備、測試程序和維修責任。~Trace one alarm to the field asset, test procedure and maintenance responsibility.|只有竣工圖而缺測試狀態，無法判斷設備是否已整合驗證。~As-built drawings without test status do not establish integrated verification.''')
project('b106','日本~Japan',41.260,140.348,'53.85 km',1988,'青函隧道於3月13日開始營業~Seikan Tunnel begins commercial operation on 13 March','海底岩盤、先進坑與長期水壓管理~Subsea rock, exploratory galleries and long-term pressure management','青函隧道把本州與北海道鐵路相連，JR北海道公開資料列總長53.85公里並於1988年開始營業。本課以海底地質預報、灌漿及水壓管理建立施工到維護的連續視角，再討論軌道、氣動、救援及設備可用性；所有計算均另列假設，不把公開總長當成每個模型的輸入。~Seikan connects the railways of Honshu and Hokkaido; JR Hokkaido reports a total length of 53.85 km and service beginning in 1988. This course links subsea forecasting, grouting and pressure management across construction and maintenance, then examines track, aerodynamics, rescue and availability. Numerical assumptions remain separate from published dimensions.','https://www.jrhokkaido.co.jp/network/seikan/01.html','JR 北海道~JR Hokkaido')
packed('b106','''route|將青函總長與真正海底段分開，檢查兩端陸域接線及坡度對列車和維護進出時間的影響。~Separate Seikan total length from its undersea portion and assess approach gradients and access for trains and maintenance.|用縱斷面標出陸海邊界及共同比較端點。~Mark land-sea boundaries and common comparison endpoints on the profile.|把總長全當海底長度會誤述暴露環境與工程數量。~Treating total length as undersea length misstates exposure and quantities.
fault|青函情境的先進坑資料需在主孔到達前更新，重點是裂隙連通和水路而非只推估完整岩石強度。~Update exploratory-gallery evidence before the main heading arrives, emphasising connected fractures and water paths rather than intact strength alone.|對照先進孔壓力回復與主孔後續揭露，標記未命中的裂隙。~Compare probe-pressure recovery with later exposure and mark missed fractures.|某孔無水不代表相鄰未探範圍缺乏連通水路。~A dry probe does not exclude connected water paths in neighbouring untested ground.
water|海面並非所有裂隙唯一測壓基準，青函教材把補注、排水和封閉區水頭分開，檢查永久外壓。~Sea level is not the sole head reference for every fracture; separate recharge, drainage and sealed-zone heads when assessing permanent pressure.|在共同高程比較不同孔位壓力及抽排變化。~Compare pressure and drainage changes at different locations on one elevation datum.|以排水孔低壓代表整個襯砌外側會漏掉隔離高壓區。~Using drain pressure for the entire lining misses isolated high-pressure zones.
grout|以青函海底封水背景研究灌漿前後水路重分配，注入量、壓力與剩餘滲透性必須分別判讀。~Study flow redistribution around hypothetical subsea grouting, interpreting injected volume, pressure and residual permeability separately.|比較試段注前注後的同條件水力試驗及鄰孔反應。~Compare before-and-after hydraulic tests under equal conditions and observe neighbouring holes.|大量吃漿可能流向遠端裂隙，不能單獨證明近掌子面已封閉。~High grout take may enter distant fractures without sealing the face vicinity.
support|長期出水與施工擾動使青函案例適合比較支護初期荷重和後續襯砌功能，不把暫時穩定當永久證明。~Compare initial support loading with later lining functions under water exposure and excavation disturbance, without equating temporary stability with permanent adequacy.|將支護荷重、收斂與水頭變化分階段對齊。~Align support force, convergence and head change by stage.|水壓回升造成的荷載若歸為岩體擠壓，會選錯分析機制。~Attributing pressure-recovery loads to squeezing selects the wrong mechanism.
rail|青函鐵路背景用來分析不同列車質量的坡度功率，另保留軌距、車輛限界及營運規則的獨立介面。~Use Seikan railway context to compare grade power by train mass while retaining separate gauge, vehicle-envelope and operating-rule interfaces.|將假想列車質量和速度與所用坡度逐項列清。~State hypothetical mass and speed explicitly against the gradient used.|坡度功率相近不代表不同車種可互換通行條件。~Similar grade power does not make different vehicle operating envelopes interchangeable.
wave|長海底鐵路的列車氣動需辨認壓力波與通風基線，教學動壓只提供速度平方的尺度。~Separate train pressure waves from baseline ventilation in a long subsea railway; teaching dynamic pressure provides only velocity-squared scaling.|比較列車通過前後壓力並扣除緩慢環境漂移。~Compare pressure before and after passage while accounting for slow environmental drift.|把慢變通風壓差納入波峰會誤判車速對波幅的影響。~Including slow ventilation pressure in the peak biases the inferred speed-wave relationship.
drain|青函長期抽排情境需同時追蹤集水容量、設備可用與補注持續性，假想停電時間不是操作允許值。~Track sump reserve, availability and continuing recharge in long-term drainage; a hypothetical outage duration is not an operating allowance.|以不同水頭下的實測泵流量核對水位上升率。~Check level-rise rate against measured pump delivery at different heads.|泵運轉指示不保證實際出流，管阻變化可令流量下降。~A running indication does not ensure discharge when pipe resistance changes.
escape|海底鐵路救援需要區分步行、列車運送與通訊延遲，青函案例的長距離使起始位置假設特別重要。~Distinguish walking, train-assisted movement and communication delay; long subsea distances make initial location assumptions particularly important.|按不同停車位置重算路徑並核對實際可通行狀態。~Recalculate routes for different stopping locations and verify usable access.|只選靠近避難點的停車位置會低估不利情境的時間。~Selecting only stops near refuge points understates adverse-scenario time.
asset|青函長期營運資料用來建立滲漏點到設備工單的關聯，區分季節水量、測器漂移與病害擴張。~Link leakage locations to maintenance records, distinguishing seasonal flow, sensor drift and expanding defects in long-term operation.|抽查同一里程多年照片、流量和修繕前後紀錄。~Sample multi-year photographs, flows and repair histories at one chainage.|位置編碼改版未對照會把同一漏點誤認成多個新缺陷。~Unmapped identifier changes make one leak appear to be several new defects.''')
project('b107','丹麥與德國~Denmark and Germany',54.659,11.351,'18 km',2020,'費馬恩海峽隧道開始施工；此年份不是通車日期~Fehmarnbelt tunnel construction begins; this is not an opening date','沉管量產、浮運落底與框架接頭~Element production, immersion and frame joints','費馬恩海峽的官方工程頁列18公里沉管隧道，並記載2020年開始施工。本課以跨國道路鐵路共同走廊為背景，逐步檢查箱體量產、重量帳、海床支承、止水接頭和設備交付。未來營運效益與施工進度分開表述，不把建設中的設施描述為已完成營運。~The official Fehmarnbelt project page describes an 18 km immersed tunnel and construction beginning in 2020. Using a cross-border road and rail corridor, this course examines element production, mass balance, seabed support, sealing and equipment handover. Future service benefits remain separate from construction progress; the facility is not described as already operational.','https://femern.com/','Sund & Bælt 費馬恩工程~Sund & Baelt Fehmarn project')
packed('b107','''route|費馬恩同時服務道路與鐵路，教學比較先固定兩端接線，分開道路車程、列車時間及施工海域範圍。~Because Fehmarnbelt carries road and rail, fix approach endpoints and separate road travel, rail travel and the marine construction boundary.|核對兩種運輸模式各自的端點與速度假設。~Check mode-specific endpoints and speed assumptions independently.|把鐵路節時套到道路會混淆接線與停站條件。~Applying rail time savings to roads mixes approach and stopping conditions.
box|費馬恩沉管採矩形箱體的教學剖面，研究中牆將頂板分跨後的框架作用，明確排除圓形薄環替代。~Use a rectangular immersed-box teaching section and examine how internal walls divide roof spans and create frame action, excluding thin-ring substitution.|比對中牆剛度變更前後頂板正負彎矩分配。~Compare positive and negative roof moments before and after changing partition stiffness.|漏列中牆會同時改變跨距、彎矩及接頭反力。~Omitting a partition changes span, bending and joint reactions together.
thermal|管節量產的混凝土溫度歷程不同於沉放後海水環境，研究早齡拘束與長期降溫的裂縫機制。~Production temperature histories differ from immersed seawater conditions; examine early restraint and later cooling as distinct cracking mechanisms.|將內外溫度、養護時間與裂縫出現日期對照。~Compare internal and surface temperatures, curing duration and crack onset.|只用最高溫忽略溫差及拘束，可能誤判裂縫原因。~Peak temperature alone misses gradients and restraint and can misdiagnose cracks.
buoyancy|費馬恩浮運教學情境把臨時封端、壓載和設備納入重量帳，研究同總質量但不同重心的差異。~Include temporary bulkheads, ballast and equipment in tow-out mass accounting and compare equal masses with different centres of gravity.|以吃水與艙內液位回查清冊，另查自由液面。~Use draught and tank levels to reconcile the register and separately assess free surfaces.|只增壓載而未評估偏心，可能改善重量帳卻惡化橫傾。~Added eccentric ballast can improve mass balance while worsening heel.
bed|海床整平和後續回填決定沉管支承，費馬恩情境須把落底瞬間與長期固結分開。~Seabed preparation and backfill determine support; distinguish first contact from long-term consolidation in the Fehmarnbelt setting.|配對海床測深、管節高程及回填時序。~Pair bathymetry, element elevation and backfill chronology.|落底後高程穩定不保證軟弱層固結已結束。~Stable elevation immediately after placement does not establish completed consolidation.
seal|連續沉放多管節時，接頭累積方向偏差和局部止水壓縮不同，研究幾何誤差如何傳到最末接合。~Across many immersed elements, accumulated alignment error and local gasket compression differ; trace geometry into the final closure.|分開核對全線坐標與每個接頭的錯台和壓縮。~Check whole-route coordinates separately from joint offset and compression.|全線位置正確仍可能有局部扭轉造成接頭漏水。~Correct overall alignment can coexist with local twist and joint leakage.
survey|海上定位、岸上控制與水下落底量測必須統一基準，教學中辨認潮位改正與姿態的耦合。~Marine positioning, shore control and underwater placement measurements need one reference; distinguish tidal correction from element attitude.|用獨立岸基控制和姿態量測檢查水下位置。~Check underwater position with independent shore control and attitude measurements.|潮位基準誤差可使多個管節共同偏高而相互吻合。~A tidal-datum bias can place several mutually aligned elements at the wrong elevation.
corrosion|海水環境下的費馬恩箱體耐久課題由材料傳輸和接縫路徑分開討論，不能只以平均混凝土係數代表全體。~Separate material transport from joint pathways in marine durability rather than representing the entire structure with one concrete coefficient.|比較未裂區與接縫鄰近區的含水和氯鹽剖面。~Compare moisture and chloride profiles in uncracked zones and near joints.|接縫快速入滲若併入材料平均值，會掩蓋局部維修需求。~Averaging rapid joint ingress into bulk material hides local repair needs.
escape|道路與鐵路同走廊的應變假設不能混用，研究不同使用者、車輛和隔離狀態對通行時間的影響。~Road and rail emergency assumptions are not interchangeable; examine how users, vehicles and isolation states change movement time.|各模式分開演練起始通知、下車與安全區轉移。~Exercise notification, detraining and safe-area transfer separately for each mode.|共用一個步速會漏掉列車下車及道路人群差異。~One walking speed omits detraining and road-user differences.
asset|量產管節需以編號串起工廠試驗、沉放位置與營運設備，研究修訂後材料紀錄是否仍可追溯。~Element identifiers must link factory tests, installed position and operational equipment after revisions to production records.|抽選管節從材料批次一路追到竣工坐標和檢修表。~Trace a sampled element from material batch to as-built position and maintenance sheet.|現場交換管節而未更新資料會使試驗證據指向錯誤位置。~Unrecorded element substitution assigns test evidence to the wrong location.''')
project('b108','土耳其~Turkey',41.010,29.012,'1387 m immersed section',2013,'馬爾馬拉跨海鐵路隧道開始服務~Marmaray cross-strait railway tunnel enters service','沉管與鑽掘接合、都會鐵路及水密變形~Immersed-to-bored transitions, urban rail and watertight deformation','馬爾馬拉跨越博斯普魯斯海峽，承包商資料列沉管段1387公尺，這不是整個鐵路計畫的長度。2013年的通車背景提供都市交通與海底工程的交會案例。本課從管節浮運、基床與接頭開始，再串接鑽掘段、軌道和救援系統，強調不同結構交界的變形相容。~Marmaray crosses the Bosphorus; contractor records identify a 1387 m immersed section, distinct from the overall railway programme. Its 2013 opening links urban transport and subsea engineering. The course follows flotation, bedding and joints into bored-tunnel transitions, track and rescue systems, emphasising compatible deformation between different structural forms.','https://holding.gama.com.tr/tr/proje/10273/','GAMA 工程公司~GAMA engineering company')
packed('b108','''route|馬爾馬拉沉管長度與整體通勤鐵路範圍必須分開，學員先辨認海峽段和兩側地下接線。~Separate the immersed crossing from the commuter-rail programme, identifying the strait section and underground approaches on both sides.|以不同顏色分列沉管、鑽掘和地面段的工程數量。~Separate quantities for immersed, bored and surface sections in the scope register.|以整線長度報沉管數量會讓造價與風險比較失真。~Using whole-line length for immersed quantities distorts cost and risk comparisons.
buoyancy|博斯普魯斯施工情境要求把浮運重量帳和海流作用分開，靜水浮力不足以描述拖航姿態。~Separate tow-out mass balance from current effects in the Bosphorus setting; still-water buoyancy cannot describe towing attitude alone.|將吃水觀測與海流、拖纜及液艙狀態同時記錄。~Record draught together with current, towline and tank states.|靜水計算正確而忽略流向變化仍可造成偏航和接近誤差。~Correct static buoyancy with changing currents omitted still permits yaw and approach error.
box|馬爾馬拉矩形沉管頂板的分跨由內牆決定，研究鐵路淨空與結構牆位置之間的協調。~Internal walls define roof spans in a rectangular tube; examine coordination between railway clearance and structural partition positions.|對照軌道限界圖和框架支承圖，檢查牆位版本。~Reconcile railway envelope and frame-support drawings, checking wall-location revisions.|設備或淨空調整若刪減支承，原條帶彎矩便失去邊界。~A clearance change removing support invalidates the original strip model.
bed|沉管到鑽掘段的剛度轉換使馬爾馬拉教學聚焦差異沉陷，不能只以海床平均高程判定接合。~The stiffness transition to bored tunnels focuses attention on differential settlement rather than mean seabed level alone.|在轉換兩側設成對高程與接頭位移基線。~Establish paired elevation and joint-movement baselines across the transition.|兩端剛度不同會把小沉陷差集中成局部轉角。~Different end stiffness can concentrate small settlement differences into local rotation.
seal|跨海接頭要容納施工偏差和假想地震相對位移，研究張開、剪移及止水壓縮不可互相替代。~Crossing joints accommodate construction tolerances and hypothetical seismic relative motion; opening, shear and compression are distinct quantities.|用組合位移試驗核對止水包絡而非單向壓縮。~Check the seal envelope with combined displacement rather than compression alone.|只驗張開而未驗剪移可能漏掉止水翻轉或局部脫離。~Testing opening without shear can miss gasket roll or local separation.
survey|水下管節與兩側鑽掘孔的控制網需要共同轉換，分析不同施工隊各自閉合但接合仍偏差的情境。~Underwater elements and bored approaches require common transformations even when each construction team reports a closed survey network.|由第三條獨立控制線核對交界方向與高程。~Use a third independent control route to check interface direction and elevation.|共用錯誤岸基點會使三段各自看似正確卻整體偏移。~A wrong shore benchmark can make separately consistent sections collectively misplaced.
rail|馬爾馬拉鐵路的坡度功率教材與車站加速分開，研究水下低點兩側坡段的符號和能量方向。~Separate grade power from station acceleration and examine slope sign and energy direction on either side of the low point.|按行車方向重算上坡與下坡分量並核對質量。~Recompute uphill and downhill terms by travel direction and check mass.|忘記坡度方向會把制動需求錯記成牽引需求。~Ignoring slope sign misclassifies braking demand as traction demand.
wave|沉管與鑽掘斷面改變可反射列車壓力波，馬爾馬拉教學將動壓尺度和交界波形分開。~Changes between immersed and bored sections can reflect train pressure waves; separate dynamic-pressure scaling from interface wave shape.|比較交界前後時間對齊的壓力訊號與車速。~Compare time-aligned pressure signals and train speed across the transition.|將交界反射峰當作車速增加會誤判氣動因果。~Mistaking a reflection peak for a speed increase misidentifies the aerodynamic cause.
escape|都市鐵路使用者密度和下車位置改變通道壅塞，馬爾馬拉案例需分別檢查列車與車站介面。~Urban passenger density and detraining position change passage congestion, requiring separate train and station-interface checks.|把下車流率與通道行走時間分開量測。~Measure detraining flow rate separately from passage walking time.|以空通道步速代表滿載列車撤離會漏掉排隊。~Using empty-passage speed for a full train omits queuing.
asset|跨國承包介面使馬爾馬拉資料交付需要統一里程、設備名稱與語言版本，研究維護查詢的可追溯性。~Cross-border contracting makes consistent chainage, naming and language revisions important for traceable maintenance queries.|抽查同一設備的現場標籤、翻譯圖紙與控制顯示。~Sample consistency among field labels, translated drawings and control displays.|翻譯名稱相似而識別碼不同會把檢修紀錄連到錯誤裝置。~Similar translated names with different identifiers can mislink maintenance records.''')
project('b109','土耳其~Turkey',41.004,28.970,'5.4 km tunnel and connection section',2016,'歐亞隧道完成並開始服務~Eurasia Tunnel is completed and launched for service','雙層道路、海底盾構與斷面系統整合~Double-deck roadway, subsea boring and section integration','歐亞隧道官方將計畫分為14.6公里走廊及其中5.4公里隧道與連接段，2016年開始服務。本課集中雙層道路圓形隧道：先檢查外水壓與襯砌，再分開樓板受力、通風、行車視覺及撤離；所有斷面尺寸及荷載算例均屬教學假設，不能當成實際設計值。~The operator distinguishes a 14.6 km corridor from its 5.4 km tunnel-and-connection section and records service beginning in 2016. This course focuses on a circular tunnel with a double-deck roadway, linking external pressure and lining to deck loads, ventilation, driver vision and evacuation. All numerical section dimensions and loads are teaching assumptions.','https://www.avrasyatuneli.com/en/corporate/what/about','歐亞隧道營運公司~Eurasia Tunnel operator')
packed('b109','''route|歐亞道路走廊與隧道連接段有不同長度範圍，先固定起訖點再比較壅塞與自由行車時間。~The road corridor and tunnel connection have different scope lengths; fix endpoints before comparing congested and free-flow travel.|核對時間資料是否包括市區引道及入口排隊。~Check whether time data include urban approaches and entrance queues.|把隧道內時間宣稱為全走廊旅行時間會誇大效益。~Presenting in-tunnel time as whole-corridor time overstates the benefit.
water|海底盾構段的外壓教材採測壓水頭，研究海面、地層和施工降水條件不一致的情境。~Use piezometric head for the subsea bored section and examine differences among sea level, strata and construction drainage conditions.|將孔壓與海潮序列比較，分辨延遲及隔離層。~Compare pore pressure with tidal histories to identify lag and isolated layers.|直接以海面深度代替所有水頭會忽略地層連通差異。~Replacing all heads with sea depth ignores differences in connectivity.
tbm|歐亞海底掘進背景用來分離切削、環片拼裝與維修停時，探討高瞬時效率未必提高日產量。~Separate cutting, segment erection and maintenance in subsea boring, testing why high instantaneous performance need not raise daily advance.|把扭矩推力與停機原因對齊同一里程。~Align torque, thrust and downtime causes at common chainage.|拼裝等待被歸為刀具問題會導致錯誤設備調整。~Erection queues labelled as cutter problems prompt incorrect machine changes.
lining|圓形襯砌承受海底外壓，同時受雙層樓板支承反力，教學薄環結果需與局部接觸分開。~The circular lining carries external pressure and internal deck reactions, requiring membrane estimates to be separated from local contact effects.|比較遠離與鄰近樓板支承處的應變和接縫變形。~Compare strain and joint movement near and away from deck supports.|均勻壓力模型可能漏掉支承處局部彎矩及裂縫。~A uniform-pressure model misses local bending and cracking at supports.
deck|歐亞雙層道路中間樓板是實際行車荷載路徑，教材條帶只示範均載彎矩，另列集中輪載需求。~The intermediate roadway deck is a traffic-load path; the teaching strip illustrates distributed bending while concentrated wheel loads remain separate.|核對行車面、支承和施工階段，不與設備隔板混用。~Check roadway surface, supports and stages without substituting equipment-partition assumptions.|把樓板當非承重分隔會漏掉交通彎剪和疲勞作用。~Treating the deck as nonstructural separation omits traffic bending, shear and fatigue.
seal|圓孔接頭與變形介面的止水能力需對應不同位移形式，研究平均壓縮合格但局部錯台的情境。~Match sealing performance to different displacement modes at ring joints and movement interfaces, including local offsets despite acceptable average compression.|將最不利角點的壓縮和剪移一起送入接頭試驗。~Use compression and shear at the adverse corner in joint tests.|只取平均縫寬會掩蓋局部止水脫離。~Mean joint width can conceal local gasket separation.
ventilation|雙層道路的通風支路與樓板隔離相互作用，研究一層門位變化是否改變另一層的風量。~Ventilation branches interact with deck separation; test whether changing doors on one level redistributes air on the other.|同步量測兩層壓差與風量，保留車流狀態。~Measure pressure and flow on both levels simultaneously and record traffic state.|兩層風機額定量相加不能代表各層實際有效換氣。~Summed fan ratings do not establish effective airflow on each level.
lighting|雙層道路入口與轉接段的視角不同，歐亞教材區分照度、路面反射及駕駛看到的亮度。~Different viewing geometries at entrances and transitions require illuminance, pavement reflection and driver-view luminance to be distinguished.|從各層駕駛視高核對亮度而非只量地面照度。~Measure luminance from each driving eye height rather than ground illuminance alone.|兩層照度相同不保證障礙物對比相同。~Equal illuminance on two levels does not ensure equal obstacle contrast.
escape|從雙層道路轉入安全通道時存在垂直及水平移動，教學時間帳要保留找門與下車延遲。~Moving from a double-deck roadway to safety combines vertical and horizontal travel with door-finding and vehicle-exit delay.|分階段記錄從車內到安全通道的實際路徑。~Record the staged route from vehicle interior to the safe passage.|只量平面最短線會漏掉樓層轉換和排隊。~A plan-view shortest line omits level changes and queues.
asset|道路系統資料需保留樓層與方向，研究相同里程上下層設備被錯配時如何影響維修和告警定位。~Asset records must retain level and direction to prevent upper- and lower-deck equipment at one chainage being confused.|抽查告警座標能否唯一定位到樓層、方向和裝置。~Test whether alarm coordinates uniquely identify level, direction and asset.|缺樓層欄位會把修繕隊送到同里程的錯誤位置。~Missing level data sends maintainers to the wrong location at the correct chainage.''')
project('b110','日本~Japan',35.464,139.875,'15.1 km whole road corridor',1997,'東京灣跨海公路的隧道施工標於12月竣工~The documented Aqua-Line tunnel construction contract is completed in December','人工島接合、海底盾構與長期鹽害~Island interfaces, subsea shield drives and marine durability','東京灣跨海公路結合海底隧道、人工島與橋梁，大林組工程史列整體道路15.1公里及1997年施工標竣工。本課把整體走廊與承包商施工範圍分開，聚焦人工島支承、地下接合、環片與止水、通風和鹽害；不把某一標段紀錄泛化為整個工程所有部位的參數。~The Tokyo Bay Aqua-Line combines a subsea tunnel, artificial islands and a bridge. Obayashi records a 15.1 km road corridor and completion of its contract in 1997. The course separates corridor and contract scope, focusing on island support, underground connections, segments, sealing, ventilation and marine deterioration without generalising one contract to every structure.','https://www.obayashi.co.jp/chronicle/works/d055.html','大林組~Obayashi Corporation')
packed('b110','''route|東京灣跨海公路的橋、島和隧道服務不同功能，教學路線比較保留人工島轉接與整條道路端點。~Bridge, island and tunnel serve different functions; retain island transitions and whole-road endpoints when comparing the crossing.|將橋長、隧道長與道路連接範圍分欄核對。~Reconcile bridge, tunnel and connecting-road scope in separate columns.|把整條道路長度當盾構掘進長度會誤估設備需求。~Treating road length as shield-drive length misstates equipment requirements.
water|人工島與海底孔的水頭邊界不同，研究島內降水和海床補注如何影響接合區壓力。~Artificial-island and subsea heads differ; examine how island drainage and seabed recharge affect connection-zone pressure.|比較島內外測壓管與潮位反應的幅度和延遲。~Compare amplitudes and lags of piezometer and tide responses inside and outside the island.|島內低水頭不代表接合外圍海床同樣卸壓。~Low island head does not establish relief in the surrounding seabed.
tbm|大直徑海底盾構的切削與環片物流互相制約，教材以Aqua-Line背景區分單次高進尺與整班利用率。~Large-diameter cutting and segment logistics interact; distinguish high short-duration advance from whole-shift utilisation in the Aqua-Line setting.|把環片到場、拼裝和切削時間對齊，找真正瓶頸。~Align segment delivery, erection and cutting times to identify the bottleneck.|提高切削速度但環片供應不足只會增加等待。~Faster cutting with inadequate segment supply merely increases waiting.
grout|海底環片背填需填補幾何空隙，教學體積不能當實際灌漿完成量，因為地層吸收和超挖仍未知。~Backfill fills geometric voids, but teaching volume cannot prove completion because ground take and overbreak remain uncertain.|將注入量、壓力和環片位移同步檢查。~Check injected volume, pressure and segment movement together.|注入量大於理論空隙可能表示流失而不是更好填充。~Injection above theoretical void volume may indicate loss rather than better filling.
lining|人工島接合和海底均勻段具有不同拘束，Aqua-Line環片教材比較均勻環向力與接合局部反力。~Island connections and uniform subsea reaches have different restraints; compare hoop force with local interface reactions.|沿接合區與一般區量測環形變形，核對支承模型。~Measure distortion at interfaces and ordinary reaches to check support assumptions.|套用一般環段模型會漏掉島體沉陷造成的局部作用。~A standard ring model misses local actions from island settlement.
seal|大林組記載接合與防水措施，本課以假想接縫研究幾何容許與實際水密試驗的差別。~Using documented connection and waterproofing context, a hypothetical joint distinguishes geometric allowance from actual pressure-test performance.|將錯台、張開和水壓組合試驗與現場幾何配對。~Match combined offset, opening and pressure tests with field geometry.|只查止水材料證明未必涵蓋現場接合位移組合。~Material certification alone may not cover the installed displacement combination.
survey|從不同人工島相向掘進的控制網需獨立覆核，研究水下接合前方向和高程不確定性。~Opposing drives from separate islands need independent control checks before underwater connection, including direction and height uncertainty.|以原始角距重算兩端網絡，交叉核對獨立接合探測。~Recompute both networks from raw observations and cross-check independent connection surveys.|兩端共用尺度錯誤可能在長距離累積而未被局部閉合發現。~Shared scale error accumulates over long drives without appearing in local closure.
bed|人工島填築地盤與海底孔連接形成差異沉陷課題，研究工後固結如何傳到柔性接合。~Reclaimed island ground creates differential settlement at the tunnel connection; examine how postconstruction consolidation reaches flexible interfaces.|將島體沉陷、孔壓及接頭轉角按同一時序比較。~Compare island settlement, pore pressure and joint rotation on one timeline.|只追蹤隧道中心高程會漏掉島體一側持續下沉。~Tunnel-centre elevation alone misses continuing settlement on the island side.
ventilation|海上通風設施與隧道內阻力構成共同網路，研究外風改變時風機工況點的移動。~Offshore ventilation structures and tunnel resistance form one network; examine operating-point changes under external wind.|同步記錄外風、風機狀態與孔內壓差。~Synchronise external wind, fan state and tunnel pressure difference.|風量下降若只歸於風機老化會漏掉外風邊界改變。~Attributing reduced flow only to ageing fans misses changed external-wind boundaries.
corrosion|海上人工島與孔內環片暴露環境不同，Aqua-Line耐久教學分開鹽霧、海水與乾燥設備區。~Separate salt spray, seawater and dry equipment zones because artificial islands and tunnel segments have different exposure environments.|按暴露區取樣，核對材料、裂縫及保護層深度。~Sample by exposure zone and check material, cracking and cover depth.|混合取樣平均值會掩蓋高鹽濕區的局部劣化。~A mixed-sample average conceals local deterioration in wet saline zones.''')
P['b108']['extra']=[dict(title='日本政府：馬爾馬拉2013年開通紀錄',titleEn='Japan government: Marmaray opening in 2013',url='https://www.gov-online.go.jp/eng/publicity/book/hlj/html/201311/201311_00_en.html',primary=True)]
