project('b114','法國與義大利~France and Italy',45.902,6.863,'11.6 km',1965,'蒙布朗隧道於7月開通~Mont Blanc Tunnel opens to traffic in July','火災系統邊界、既有襯砌與跨境協作~Fire-system boundaries, existing lining and cross-border coordination','蒙布朗隧道連接法國與義大利，營運機構列長11.6公里並記錄1965年開通。本課以長公路的系統思考為主軸，分別研究通風網路、受熱材料、事故偵知、人的反應、設備冗餘及整修交付。歷史事件只用核對過的年代，假想事故條件不被包裝為原事故重建。~Mont Blanc Tunnel connects France and Italy; its operator reports 11.6 km and opening in 1965. This course uses a systems perspective on ventilation networks, heated materials, detection, human response, redundancy and refurbishment handover. Historical dates follow checked records, while hypothetical incident conditions are not presented as reconstruction of an actual accident.','https://www.atmb.com/connaitre-atmb/qui-est-atmb/le-tunnel-du-mont-blanc-ouvrage-exceptionnel-innovant-et-securise/','ATMB 營運機構~ATMB operator')
packed('b114','''route|蒙布朗跨境服務涉及兩端引道和管制，教材比較相同端點的洞內時間及整體等待而非單一最短車程。~Cross-border service includes approaches and controls; compare in-tunnel time and total waiting between common endpoints rather than one shortest journey.|將正常行車和入口排隊時間分開紀錄。~Record ordinary travel and entrance queue time separately.|隧道內暢通不代表兩端交通系統沒有瓶頸。~Free flow inside does not establish unconstrained approaches.
ventilation|蒙布朗案例用來研究正常污染稀釋與假想火災控煙的不同目標，不能只提高風量就宣稱情境改善。~Distinguish normal pollutant dilution from hypothetical fire smoke-control objectives; more airflow alone does not prove an improved scenario.|在不同受控邊界下比較風向、門位及抽排分布。~Compare airflow direction, door states and extraction distribution under distinct controlled boundaries.|錯誤風向可能把煙帶向人員區，即使總風量增加。~Wrong airflow direction can carry smoke toward users despite increased total flow.
thermal|假想受熱襯砌的熱膨脹拘束與混凝土剝落屬不同機制，蒙布朗教材只以線彈性式建立量級。~Restrained expansion and concrete spalling are different mechanisms; a linear-elastic exercise establishes scale without predicting actual fire damage.|將溫度深度分布、含水和裂縫方向一起檢查。~Check temperature through depth, moisture and crack orientation together.|均溫模型不能代表表層急熱梯度及剝落。~Uniform temperature cannot represent rapid surface gradients or spalling.
lining|長期整修需區分原有缺陷與新病害，蒙布朗襯砌教學以幾何、材料和支承證據重建荷載路徑。~Refurbishment separates legacy defects from new deterioration using geometry, material and support evidence to reconstruct load paths.|對照歷年裂縫圖、掃描斷面及滲水位置。~Compare historical crack maps, scanned sections and leak locations.|把所有新看見的裂縫當新產生會錯估劣化速率。~Treating newly observed cracks as newly formed overstates deterioration rate.
lighting|事故和正常行車需要不同的視覺資訊，教材把路面照明與方向標示的可見性分開。~Normal driving and incident response need different visual information; distinguish road lighting from visibility of directional signs.|從停車人員和駕駛兩種視角核對標示及亮度。~Check signs and luminance from stopped-user and driving viewpoints.|行車視角合格不保證下車後能辨識安全路徑。~Adequate driving visibility does not prove that a user on foot can identify the safe route.
escape|蒙布朗假想情境將偵知、決策、下車和步行分段，避免只以出口距離估算完整撤離。~Separate detection, decision, vehicle exit and walking in a hypothetical Mont Blanc scenario rather than estimating total evacuation from distance alone.|演練按時間戳辨認各階段，保留不同起始位置。~Timestamp each exercise stage and retain varied starting positions.|反應延遲被省略時，精確步速仍會產生偏低總時間。~Omitted response delay produces a low total despite precise walking speed.
reliability|偵知、通訊和供電構成串聯依賴，教材研究兩套感測器共用控制器時為何不能直接平方失效率。~Detection, communication and power form dependencies; examine why two sensors on one controller do not justify squaring failure probability.|沿告警鏈逐點確認共用設備和故障傳遞。~Trace shared equipment and fault propagation along the alarm chain.|共同控制器失效會同時切斷兩個看似獨立感測通道。~A common controller failure disables two apparently independent sensing channels.
drain|道路水、清洗水和滲水在假想集水系統中有不同時間尺度，教材分析同時進流對容量的影響。~Road water, wash water and seepage have different time scales; assess coincident inflows into a hypothetical sump.|將清洗計畫與降雨和泵曲線一起閉合水量帳。~Close the balance using cleaning schedules, rainfall and pump curves.|只依平日滲水選泵會漏掉清洗或事件排水尖峰。~Sizing from routine seepage alone misses wash or incident-drainage peaks.
logistics|蒙布朗整修窗口包含隔離、施工和重新測試，短期關閉的有效工時不能以日曆時間直接估算。~Refurbishment windows include isolation, work and retesting; productive hours differ from calendar closure duration.|用完整作業鏈核對材料搬運和恢復測試占時。~Check material handling and restoration tests within the full work sequence.|省略重測會留下設備已安裝但未證明可用的狀態。~Omitted retesting leaves installed equipment without demonstrated availability.
asset|跨境營運資料需讓事件時間、設備狀態與工單互相對應，蒙布朗教材要求保留事件版本而非覆寫。~Cross-border records must align event times, asset states and work orders while preserving revisions instead of overwriting history.|抽查一個事件從偵知到維修完成的資料鏈。~Trace one event from detection through maintenance completion.|時鐘不同步會顛倒事件順序而誤導根因分析。~Unsynchronised clocks reverse apparent event order and mislead root-cause analysis.''')
eventsource('b114','https://www.atmb.com/connaitre-atmb/histoire-datmb-les-dates-cles-de-la40-la-rn205-et-le-tunnel-du-mont-blanc/histoire/histoire-du-tunnel-du-mont-blanc/','ATMB')
project('b115','法國與義大利~France and Italy',45.187,6.704,'12.87 km original tunnel',1980,'弗雷瑞斯原公路隧道開始服務~The original Frejus Road Tunnel enters service','新舊孔切換、重車服務與維護隔離~Old-new bore transfer, freight service and maintenance isolation','法國交通主管機關列弗雷瑞斯原隧道12.87公里、1980年營運，並於2025年公告第二孔開通活動。本課不把原始單孔狀態當成永久現況，而以新舊孔轉換為主軸，研究重車交通、岩體、通風隔離、跨孔救援與設備版本，建立分階段可驗證的營運模型。~The French transport ministry records the original Frejus tunnel as 12.87 km, in service from 1980, and announced the second-tube opening event in 2025. The course does not treat the original single-bore arrangement as permanent. It studies staged transfer, freight traffic, rock behaviour, airflow isolation, cross-bore rescue and equipment revisions.','https://www.ecologie.gouv.fr/presse/inauguration-philippe-tabarot-du-second-tube-du-tunnel-du-frejus-lundi-28-juillet-2025','法國交通主管機關~French transport ministry')
packed('b115','''route|弗雷瑞斯由原孔到第二孔的配置變化需先定義階段，教材把道路容量、救援通道和施工空間分開。~Define configuration stages before comparing the original and second tubes, separating road capacity, rescue access and construction space.|每個方案附日期和孔別，不混用不同時期示意圖。~Attach dates and bore identifiers to each option and avoid mixing historical diagrams.|把舊單孔描述用於新配置會錯估對向衝突及逃生路線。~Applying an old single-bore description misstates opposing traffic and escape routes.
fault|平行第二孔可利用原孔資料但不能省略新探查，弗雷瑞斯教材研究斜交節理在兩孔位置的差異。~The second tube can use first-bore records without replacing new investigation; examine oblique joints crossing each bore at different positions.|將構造方位投影到兩孔里程，再用新揭露驗證。~Project structural orientation onto both chainages and test against new exposures.|按相同里程直接配對地質會忽略斜交造成的位置差。~Matching geology at equal chainage ignores offsets caused by oblique structures.
stress|第二孔開挖與原孔營運並存時需檢查岩柱應力重分配，單孔覆土估算只是起點。~When excavation coexists with first-bore operation, examine pillar stress redistribution beyond a single-hole cover estimate.|把原孔位移與新掌子面距離對齊，排除溫度漂移。~Align old-bore movement with new-face distance while excluding thermal drift.|未扣溫度的位移可能被誤判成新孔造成的地盤作用。~Uncorrected thermal movement can be misattributed to excavation interaction.
support|弗雷瑞斯新舊支護設計背景不同，教材比較荷載啟動時點及長期劣化，不只比較材料強度。~New and old support have different histories; compare activation time and ageing rather than material strength alone.|分別建立新支護荷重與舊支護檢查的時間基準。~Maintain separate time references for new support loads and legacy inspections.|新支護較強不能證明舊孔整修可省略施工階段分析。~Stronger new support does not remove staging analysis for old-bore refurbishment.
lining|重車公路的襯砌和設備支承有不同作用，教材用均勻外壓示例後再辨識附掛設備局部荷載。~Lining and equipment supports carry different actions; follow a uniform-pressure example with identification of local suspended loads.|核對設備錨固位置、裂縫圖及襯砌實際厚度。~Check equipment anchorage, crack maps and actual lining thickness.|新增設備未回查襯砌狀態可能把局部負擔集中在弱區。~New equipment without lining-condition checks can concentrate load in weak zones.
ventilation|分向孔與原雙向情境的車流助風不同，弗雷瑞斯教材要求換孔後重新核對通風邊界。~Directional tubes differ from former bidirectional traffic in piston effects; recheck airflow boundaries after configuration changes.|對比切換前後同風機設定的實測壓差和流量。~Compare measured pressure and flow at equal fan settings before and after transfer.|沿用舊控制參數可能在新車流方向下產生不符預期風向。~Old controls may produce unintended airflow under the new traffic direction.
lighting|新舊孔表面與燈具狀態不同，教學比較相同照度下路面反射造成的亮度差。~Different surfaces and luminaires in old and new tubes can produce different luminance at equal illuminance.|以同視角和乾濕條件比較兩孔的光度量測。~Compare photometry in both tubes under equal viewing and wetness conditions.|以新孔量測代表舊孔會低估老化表面與燈具影響。~New-tube measurements do not represent aged surfaces and lamps in the old tube.
escape|跨孔撤離先確認鄰孔交通已處於受控狀態，教材將橫通道距離與安全孔可用性分開。~Cross-bore evacuation first requires a controlled receiving tube; separate passage distance from receiving-bore availability.|演練同步核對交通隔離、門位和人員到達時間。~Exercise traffic isolation, door state and arrival timing together.|橫通道到達快不代表鄰孔車流已安全停止。~Fast passage arrival does not establish stopped traffic in the receiving bore.
reliability|兩孔控制若共享通訊骨幹，表面設備成雙仍可能共同失效，研究切換與隔離的測試範圍。~Shared communications can defeat apparent twin-bore redundancy; examine the scope of transfer and isolation tests.|追查兩孔感測、控制和供電的共同節點。~Trace shared sensing, control and power nodes across both bores.|只測單台停機不能揭露骨幹失效造成的雙孔影響。~Single-unit outage tests miss shared-backbone failure affecting both tubes.
asset|弗雷瑞斯版本交付應保留原孔和新孔獨立設備樹，避免複製名稱後遺失安裝日期及測試狀態。~Maintain separate asset trees for old and new tubes, preserving installation dates and test states when names are copied.|抽查同名設備是否有唯一孔別、位置和維護週期。~Check similarly named assets have unique bore, location and maintenance interval.|錯把新孔測試結果覆蓋舊孔會形成虛假的驗收證據。~Overwriting old-bore records with new-bore tests creates false acceptance evidence.''')
project('b116','奧地利與義大利~Austria and Italy',47.219,11.408,'55 km base tunnel; 64 km linked route',2014,'Tulfes–Pfons施工標開始施工；不是全工程通車日期~Work starts on the Tulfes–Pfons lot; this is not whole-project opening','先進坑、長距離多工作面與跨境基準~Exploratory gallery, multiple long drives and cross-border datums','布倫納官方區分55公里基線隧道與包含既有繞行連接的64公里地下路線，並說明下方先進坑的地質調查和未來維護用途。本課由這個三孔系統出發，分析探查更新、多工作面物流、岩體水壓、控制網與軌道需求；各標段里程碑不被誤寫為全工程完工。~BBT distinguishes the 55 km base tunnel from a 64 km linked underground route including the existing bypass and describes the lower exploratory gallery. This course follows that three-tunnel system through geological updates, multi-heading logistics, rock and water response, survey control and railway needs. Lot milestones are not presented as whole-project completion.','https://www.bbt-se.com/en/brenner-base-tunnel/project-overview/','布倫納基線隧道公司~Brenner Base Tunnel BBT SE')
packed('b116','''route|布倫納55公里主體與64公里連接路線有不同端點，教材先分開工程數量、列車行程與支坑總長。~The 55 km main works and 64 km linked route have different endpoints; separate quantities, train travel and total gallery length.|核對每種長度是否沿同一路徑及包含既有段。~Check whether each length follows the same route and includes existing sections.|把64公里當新建主孔長度會重複計入既有連接。~Using 64 km as new main-bore length double-counts existing connections.
fault|下方先進坑提供布倫納主孔前方資訊，但高程差使構造外推需保留不確定性。~The lower exploratory gallery informs main-bore forecasts, but elevation separation leaves uncertainty in projecting structures upward.|以裂隙方位投影到主孔，再用超前孔覆核。~Project fractures to main-bore level and check with advance probes.|先進坑乾燥不證明上方主孔不會遇另一連通水帶。~A dry exploratory gallery does not exclude another connected water zone above.
water|三孔系統的排水互相影響，布倫納教材研究先進坑降水如何改變主孔施工與永久水頭。~Drainage interacts across three galleries; examine how exploratory-gallery relief changes main-bore construction and permanent heads.|同步比較三孔壓力、流量與補注事件。~Compare pressure, flow and recharge events across all three galleries.|把三孔出流相加而未查連通可能重複估計獨立補注。~Summing flows without connectivity checks can double-count supposedly independent recharge.
stress|長基線隧道穿越不同覆土和構造，教材把彈性洞壁應力與節理控制破壞分開選模。~A long base tunnel crosses varying cover and structure; distinguish elastic wall stress from joint-controlled failure when selecting models.|比較原位應力方向、破壞方位和分段收斂。~Compare in-situ stress directions, damage orientation and segment convergence.|單用覆土排序危險程度會漏掉低覆土弱帶的變形。~Ranking hazard by cover alone misses deformation in weak shallow zones.
support|多標段支護設計需要一致證據格式但不必相同參數，布倫納教材研究地質分區與封閉時序。~Different lots need consistent evidence formats without identical parameters; examine ground domains and closure timing.|將相同開挖齡期的荷重及收斂放在同地質組比較。~Compare loads and convergence at equal excavation age within one ground domain.|跨地質平均參數會把真正局部擠壓訊號稀釋。~Averaging across geology dilutes genuine local squeezing signals.
tbm|布倫納多機多工作面背景適合比較利用率，教材按岩性和停時原因校正後才比較日進尺。~Multiple machines and headings require comparisons normalised by ground and downtime cause before daily advance is ranked.|以完整班次重建切削、拼裝、保養和運輸時間帳。~Reconstruct cutting, erection, maintenance and transport over complete shifts.|最佳機器日進尺不能直接代表整個工程平均產能。~The best machine day does not represent project-average production.
logistics|側向施工入口和先進坑共用運輸網，教材研究一個出渣節點故障如何影響多工作面。~Side accesses and exploratory galleries form a shared network; examine how one spoil-node outage propagates to several headings.|用排隊時間和緩衝存量找出串聯瓶頸。~Identify serial bottlenecks from queue time and buffer inventory.|各面名目產量相加會忽略共同卸料設備的容量。~Summed face ratings omit capacity of shared unloading equipment.
survey|跨境兩端控制網需統一坐標尺度與高程，布倫納教材特別檢查地表到深部基準傳遞。~Cross-border networks require common scale and elevation, with explicit checks on transfer from surface to depth.|由獨立網重算尺度及定向，保留溫度改正資料。~Recompute scale and orientation independently and retain thermal corrections.|同一轉換參數用錯可讓兩國網各自閉合卻整體錯接。~A wrong shared transformation permits local closure but a global mismatch.
rail|低坡度是布倫納運輸目的之一，教材計算坡度功率後另外列出加速、氣動與列車間距需求。~Low gradient supports the transport purpose; calculate grade power while separately listing acceleration, aerodynamics and spacing demands.|核對坡度無因次換算及列車質量，再比同速方案。~Check dimensionless grade conversion and mass before equal-speed comparison.|把千分比當百分比會使坡度功率放大十倍。~Confusing per mille with percent multiplies grade power by ten.
asset|先進坑由調查轉為維護用途時，資料需保留地質與設備兩種索引，避免施工資料在營運期失聯。~As the exploratory gallery gains a maintenance role, preserve both geological and equipment indexing through handover.|從維修位置反查該里程探查、支護和排水紀錄。~Trace a maintenance location back to investigation, support and drainage records.|只有設備清單而缺地質里程連結會妨礙異常水量診斷。~An asset list without geological chainage linkage impedes abnormal-inflow diagnosis.''')
