project('b117','台灣~Taiwan',23.917,121.048,'6.5 km TBM middle section within 16.5 km conveyance scope',2002,'台電記錄的中段TBM掘進於6月貫通~The documented middle-section TBM drive achieves breakthrough in June','引水能量、水文地質與TBM規劃整合~Conveyance energy, hydrogeology and TBM planning integration','台電典藏說明新武界及栗栖溪引水工程的規劃與施工，列16.5公里引水範圍及其中6.5公里TBM中段，記錄2002年該掘進段貫通。本課把土木、地質與水力目的串接，研究水路能量、探查代表性、支護和施工物流；這些尺度不被混寫成單一孔全長或發電容量。~Taipower describes planning and construction for New Wujie and Lixi conveyance, including a 16.5 km scope and a 6.5 km TBM middle section that broke through in 2002. This course connects civil, geological and hydraulic purposes through energy, investigation, support and logistics, without confusing those scopes with one bore length or generating capacity.','https://service.taipower.com.tw/Collection/2009/2025/8709/','台灣電力公司~Taiwan Power Company')
packed('b117','''waterroute|新武界是引水工程，路線由取水、出口水位和能量坡度決定，教材用水體平流而非車輛旅行時間。~New Wujie is a conveyance work; intake, outlet level and energy gradient define the route, so the example uses water advection rather than vehicle travel.|核對上下游水位基準和各引水支路的連接範圍。~Check level datum and connection scope for upstream, downstream and branch inflows.|把引水長度直接換成交通效益會完全失去功能邊界。~Converting conveyance length into a traffic benefit loses the functional boundary.
fault|台電記錄強調探查與機械配合，本課研究長水平孔的岩性代表性及未探區裂隙不確定度。~Taipower emphasises investigation-machine coordination; examine representativeness of a long horizontal probe and fracture uncertainty outside it.|以後續揭露核對探孔預測，標記偏離路線的取樣區。~Check probe predictions against later exposure and mark sampled areas away from the alignment.|一支長孔仍可能平行錯過不利構造，長度不等於完整覆蓋。~A long hole can run parallel to an adverse structure; length is not complete coverage.
water|引水隧道施工時外部地下水與營運時內水壓方向不同，教材把內外壓組合按階段列清。~External groundwater during excavation and internal conveyance pressure during operation act differently; list pressure combinations by stage.|比較空洞、充水和停水狀態的內外測壓基準。~Compare internal and external pressure references for empty, filled and shutdown states.|只驗滿水時淨內壓會漏掉放空後外壓控制情境。~Checking filled-state net internal pressure misses external pressure after draining.
tbm|公開資料的最高日進尺與月平均是不同統計量，本課以新武界背景重建班次利用率而非追逐紀錄。~Published peak daily and mean monthly advance are different statistics; reconstruct shift utilisation rather than treating a production record as normal.|將最高日、完整月份與停機日納入同一時間帳。~Include peak day, full month and stoppage days in one time balance.|最高日乘整月會系統性高估施工進度。~Multiplying the peak day by a month systematically overstates progress.
support|引水隧道的初期支護先穩定開挖，永久內襯還有水理和耐久功能，教材明確區分兩者驗證。~Initial support stabilises excavation while permanent lining also serves hydraulics and durability; verify these functions separately.|以施工收斂與後續內襯幾何資料分階段核對。~Check construction convergence and later lining geometry as separate stages.|初期支護穩定不能證明永久水理斷面已達需求。~Stable initial support does not establish the permanent hydraulic section.
hydraulic|新武界水理教材以滿管摩阻建立能量帳，再列閘門瞬變和可能自由水面轉換的額外需求。~Build a full-pipe friction balance, then identify separate gate-transient and possible free-surface-transition requirements.|用同時流量和水位反算水頭損失，保留閘門狀態。~Infer head loss from simultaneous flow and levels with gate state recorded.|把非穩態壓力峰用來反算粗糙度會產生失真參數。~Inferring roughness from transient peaks produces misleading parameters.
lining|引水內襯的平整度和接縫同時影響摩阻與結構，教材將環向量級和局部缺陷分開。~Lining smoothness and joints affect hydraulics and structure; separate hoop-force scale from local defects.|把斷面掃描、接縫錯台和水理損失資料連結。~Link section scans, joint offsets and hydraulic-loss data.|平均直徑合格仍可能有局部縮頸造成額外損失。~Acceptable mean diameter can conceal local constrictions and excess loss.
survey|引水坡度微小時高程誤差可改變排水與淨空判讀，新武界教材強調共同高程基準。~With small conveyance gradients, height errors alter drainage and clearance interpretation; maintain a common elevation reference.|由獨立水準路線重算進出口及中段高程。~Recompute inlet, outlet and intermediate elevations through independent levelling.|角度閉合好不證明縱斷面水準沒有系統偏差。~Good angular closure does not establish an unbiased longitudinal level profile.
logistics|山區引水工程多面施工仍受材料、出渣及維修通道限制，教材把機械產能與供應節拍分開。~Multiple mountain headings remain limited by material, spoil and maintenance access; distinguish machine capacity from supply cycle.|核對環片或內襯材料、刀具和出渣的共用占時。~Check shared access time for lining materials, cutters and spoil.|出渣優先若排擠刀具維修會降低後續有效切削時間。~Spoil priority that displaces cutter maintenance reduces later productive cutting.
environment|引水目的與施工排水可能改變不同流域受體，本課以水量帳區分轉移水、地層滲水和天然補注。~Conveyance and construction drainage affect different receptors; separate transferred water, groundwater inflow and natural recharge.|明示集水區和時間邊界，以對照點核對季節變化。~State catchment and time boundaries and use controls to check seasonality.|將轉引水量視為地下水損失會錯估環境影響來源。~Treating diverted surface water as groundwater loss misidentifies environmental effects.''')
project('b118','台灣~Taiwan',24.387,121.775,'approximately 7.9 km',2016,'公路機關記錄觀音隧道貫通里程碑~The highway authority records a Guanyin Tunnel breakthrough milestone','弱帶、多工作面與長隧道系統聯動~Weak zones, multiple headings and linked tunnel systems','公路機關列觀音隧道約7.9公里、雙孔單向配置，並記錄利用舊北迴隧道增加施工工作面。本課從這項既有設施再利用出發，分析地質弱帶、地下水、控制網、施工交通與通風設備介面；貫通和2020年蘇花改全線通車是不同事件，課程不把兩者混為一談。~The highway authority describes Guanyin as approximately 7.9 km with twin directional bores and reuse of an old railway tunnel to create working faces. This course follows weak ground, groundwater, survey, construction traffic and ventilation interfaces. Breakthrough and the 2020 opening of the full Suhua improvement corridor remain distinct events.','https://www.thb.gov.tw/News_Content.aspx?Create=1&n=87&s=51127','交通部公路局~Taiwan Highway Bureau')
packed('b118','''route|觀音與鄰接谷風及短橋形成連續服務路廊，教材分開單隧道里程與系統連續行車範圍。~Guanyin and neighbouring tunnel-bridge links form a continuous corridor; distinguish one tunnel length from the operational route.|以相同起訖點核對觀音、橋及鄰洞的範圍。~Reconcile Guanyin, bridge and adjacent-bore scope between fixed endpoints.|只看單洞長度可能漏掉鄰洞事故對交通及救援的影響。~Single-bore length misses adjacent-tunnel effects on traffic and rescue.
fault|觀音公開論壇討論地質弱帶，本課研究裂隙填充、產狀和掌子面水量如何共同修正預報。~Official technical forums discuss weak zones; combine infill, orientation and face inflow to update forecasts.|按工作面和里程整理弱帶類型與後續支護反應。~Organise weak-zone types and support response by face and chainage.|同一弱帶名稱可能含不同水理連通性，不能只套固定參數。~One weak-zone label can hide differing connectivity and cannot dictate fixed parameters.
water|舊鐵路坑與新道路孔可能形成水力聯繫，教材檢查增加工作面後出水重新分配的假想情境。~Old railway galleries and new road bores may interact hydraulically; test hypothetical flow redistribution after new access opens.|同步記錄舊坑及新孔水頭與出流變化。~Synchronise old-gallery and new-bore head and flow changes.|新孔水少可能只是舊坑先截水，並非地層原本乾燥。~Low new-bore flow may reflect interception by the old gallery rather than dry ground.
support|多工作面通過弱帶的支護時序不同，教材比較相同地質但不同封閉時間的收斂荷重。~Different headings cross weak zones with different closure timing; compare loads and convergence within the same geology.|將封閉時間標在各工作面的同齡期曲線。~Mark closure time on age-aligned histories from each heading.|按施工日期直接比較會混入不同開挖齡期。~Comparing calendar dates directly mixes different excavation ages.
logistics|既有鐵路坑增設工作面也帶來共享通道瓶頸，觀音教材用完整循環檢查材料與出渣交會。~Reusing a railway gallery adds headings but also shared-access bottlenecks; examine complete material and spoil cycles.|對照各面出渣需求、交會等待及卸料能力。~Compare heading demand, passing queues and unloading capacity.|工作面數增加不能直接倍增每日總進尺。~More headings do not directly multiply daily total advance.
survey|多面貫通需把舊坑坐標傳入新孔，教材分析歷史基準與現代控制網轉換的誤差。~Multiple breakthroughs require transfer from old-gallery coordinates into new bores, including historical-to-modern datum errors.|用新地表控制獨立覆核舊坑基準與方向。~Independently recheck old-gallery references and orientation from new surface control.|舊坑幾何吻合不證明其坐標可直接用於新道路孔。~Agreement with old-gallery geometry does not validate direct coordinate reuse.
deck|觀音通風機房及管道情境中的隔板是設備風道構件，不是雙層道路樓板，荷載功能必須先辨認。~A ventilation-room or duct partition is an equipment-airway component, not a double-deck roadway slab; establish its function first.|核對隔板支承、風壓及維修荷載，不套車輪荷載。~Check partition supports, air pressure and maintenance loading without substituting wheel loads.|將風道隔板當行車樓板會錯置荷載與檢核目的。~Treating an airway partition as a roadway deck misassigns loads and checks.
ventilation|觀音與相鄰設施的通風控制需保留門位和車流邊界，教材分析設備維修時支路阻力重分配。~Ventilation control must retain door and traffic boundaries across linked facilities; examine resistance redistribution during maintenance.|同步比較風門狀態、機房壓差與孔內風速。~Compare damper state, plant-room pressure and in-bore velocity simultaneously.|機房風量正常可能伴隨風道漏風而使道路區效果不足。~Normal plant flow can coexist with duct leakage and inadequate roadway flow.
escape|連續長隧道路廊的救援需確認鄰孔及出口狀態，教材把最短橫通道距離和完整轉移路徑分開。~A linked long-tunnel corridor needs receiving-bore and exit checks; separate nearest passage distance from the complete transfer route.|走查橫通道後續路徑及實際門位，保留施工封閉。~Walk the route beyond each passage and record actual doors and closures.|到達橫通道並不等於已抵達可持續停留的安全位置。~Reaching a cross passage does not establish arrival at a sustainable safe location.
asset|舊坑再利用與新機電資料須保留不同來源和狀態，教材檢查舊圖與竣工圖的里程對照。~Reuse and new systems require distinct provenance and status; check chainage mapping between old and as-built drawings.|抽查現場設備可否回溯到新孔里程與舊坑介面。~Trace field assets to new-bore chainage and old-gallery interfaces.|舊新里程混用會把漏水和設備工單派到不同實體位置。~Mixed old and new chainages assign leak and equipment work orders to different physical locations.''')
eventsource('b118','https://tra.hccp.gov.tw/blogs/1930','Hsinchu City Police / Taiwan highway release')
project('b119','中國香港、珠海與澳門~Hong Kong, Zhuhai and Macao',22.300,113.906,'approximately 7 km tunnel section',2018,'港珠澳大橋跨海交通工程開始服務~The Hong Kong–Zhuhai–Macao crossing enters service','外海沉管、人工島與長期接頭變形~Open-sea immersion, artificial islands and long-term joint movement','香港政府工程頁把港珠澳主橋分為約23公里海上高架及約7公里隧道段，並說明外海沉管浮運落底的環境挑戰。本課集中隧道和人工島介面，循序分析箱體框架、浮力、基床、止水、測量及耐久；主橋、整體跨海計畫和沉管段的尺度各自保留原計量邊界。~The Hong Kong government separates the main crossing into about 23 km of viaduct and 7 km of tunnel and describes open-sea immersion challenges. This course focuses on tunnel-island interfaces through box-frame action, buoyancy, bedding, seals, surveying and durability. Main-crossing, whole-programme and immersed-section dimensions retain their distinct measurement boundaries.','https://www.hzmb.gov.hk/en/main-bridge.html','香港政府港珠澳大橋資訊~Hong Kong government HZMB information')
packed('b119','''route|港珠澳的橋、隧道與口岸不是同一工程範圍，教材先確定隧道段端點再比較道路服務。~Bridge, tunnel and border facilities have different scope; define tunnel endpoints before comparing road service.|在數量表分開主橋、隧道與接線里程。~Separate main crossing, tunnel and approach lengths in the quantity register.|把整體跨海長度當沉管長度會放大水下施工數量。~Using total crossing length as immersed length inflates underwater quantities.
box|港珠澳沉管是矩形多室箱體，教材研究中牆對頂板跨距的控制，禁止以圓環膜應力取代框架。~The immersed structure is a multicell rectangular box; examine how partitions control roof spans without substituting circular-ring membrane stress.|核對每個室的支承與荷載分配，再作局部條帶比較。~Check support and load distribution for each cell before local strip comparison.|忽略內牆連續性可能錯估支點負彎矩與裂縫位置。~Ignoring wall continuity misstates support hogging and crack location.
buoyancy|外海管節浮運需將重量、波浪和流場分開，教材的剩餘浮力只能說明靜態垂直力。~Open-sea towing needs separate mass, wave and current assessments; residual buoyancy describes only static vertical force.|以吃水、液艙水位及重量清冊互查，另列海況。~Cross-check draught, tank levels and the mass register while recording sea state separately.|相同剩餘浮力的兩個壓載配置可能有不同傾斜穩性。~Two ballast arrangements with equal residual buoyancy can have different heel stability.
bed|人工島附近與中央沉管的地層支承不同，教材追蹤差異固結對接頭轉角的影響。~Island approaches and central tubes have different support conditions; trace differential consolidation into joint rotation.|按管節編號對照沉陷、孔壓及回填時間。~Compare settlement, pore pressure and backfill timing by element identifier.|只核總沉陷可能漏掉島隧轉換處的局部折角。~Total settlement alone misses local angular distortion at island transitions.
seal|長管列的接頭壓縮與閉合段幾何相互限制，教材分開局部水密包絡與全線累積誤差。~Joint compression and closure geometry interact across the long element chain; separate local seal envelopes from accumulated alignment error.|各接頭記錄張開、錯台與水壓，閉合段再核總幾何。~Record opening, offset and pressure at each joint and separately check closure geometry.|全線貫通不證明每個接頭都在水密試驗包絡內。~Geometric closure does not prove every joint lies within the tested seal envelope.
survey|海上沉放量測須處理潮位、姿態和控制網版本，教材研究偏差如何沿管列累積。~Immersion surveying must handle tide, attitude and control revisions; examine accumulated bias along the element chain.|以獨立岸基觀測覆核定位及落底後高程。~Independently check positioning and post-placement elevation from shore control.|多次觀測若共用錯誤潮位基準，不會自行消除高程偏差。~Repeated observations sharing a wrong tidal datum do not remove elevation bias.
thermal|大型預製箱體受早期水化熱與後續降溫，教材把熱應力量級和裂縫水密要求分開。~Large precast boxes experience hydration heat and later cooling; distinguish thermal-stress scale from crack-watertightness requirements.|比較厚壁內外溫差及拘束位置的裂縫分布。~Compare through-wall gradients with cracking near restraints.|單一平均溫度無法代表厚壁熱梯度引起的局部應力。~One average temperature does not represent local stress from thick-wall gradients.
corrosion|外海鹽水環境下箱體表面與接頭傳輸不同，教材將擴散特徵長度和鋼筋腐蝕啟動分開。~Box surfaces and joints transport chloride differently; distinguish characteristic diffusion length from reinforcement corrosion initiation.|按裂縫與未裂區分層取樣，不把接縫水當材料係數。~Sample cracked and uncracked zones separately rather than fitting joint water into a material coefficient.|高滲透接頭可能控制局部病害，平均擴散值會掩蓋它。~A permeable joint can govern local deterioration concealed by mean diffusivity.
ventilation|隧道與人工島通風設施互為邊界，教材研究島上外風與孔內車流對工況點的聯合作用。~Island ventilation facilities and the tunnel share boundaries; examine external wind and traffic effects on operating points.|同步量測外風、風機狀態、風道壓差及道路風速。~Synchronise wind, fan state, duct pressure and roadway velocity.|額定風量不含島上風壓變化，不能直接代表實際換氣。~Rated flow excludes varying island wind pressure and is not actual ventilation.
asset|管節量產與多區施工的資料須對應最終安裝位置，教材檢查材料批次、接頭和檢修點的關聯。~Production and multiple work zones need records tied to final installation, linking batches, joints and inspection points.|由一個漏點反查管節編號、試驗和接頭施工紀錄。~Trace one leak to element identity, tests and joint-construction records.|編號沿用工廠順序而未改安裝序會錯配維修證據。~Keeping factory order instead of installed order mislinks repair evidence.''')
eventsource('b119','https://www.cso.gov.hk/eng/blog/blog20181111.htm','Hong Kong Chief Secretary for Administration')
project('b120','中國~China',22.882,113.522,'10.8 km',2011,'獅子洋隧道於12月開通營運~Shiziyang Tunnel opens for service in December','混合掌子面、高速軌道與水下接合~Mixed faces, high-speed track and underwater connection','國家鐵路局公開技術資料列獅子洋隧道10.8公里、雙孔單線，並記錄2011年12月通車及軟土、土岩複合與岩層的變化。本課從地層切換到結構和軌道平順性，串接長距離盾構、接合測量、列車氣動及救援；公開設計數字與本課假想模型分開呈現。~The National Railway Administration records Shiziyang as 10.8 km with twin single-track bores, opening in December 2011 through soft soil, mixed and rock strata. This course links ground transitions to structural and track geometry, long shield drives, connection surveys, train aerodynamics and rescue, keeping published design context separate from teaching calculations.','https://source.nra.gov.cn/ztzl/hy/kjcx/kjxm/201802/t20180212_198473.shtml','中國國家鐵路局~China National Railway Administration')
packed('b120','''route|獅子洋總隧道與盾構段的範圍不同，教材先確認雙孔單線的計量方式，不把兩孔相加當列車行程。~Total tunnel and shielded sections have different extents; define twin single-track measurement without adding both bores into train travel distance.|核對中心線長、總開挖長與接線範圍。~Reconcile centreline travel length, total excavation length and approaches.|把雙孔工程量當單趟長度會使時間和容量估算加倍。~Using twin-bore quantities as one journey length doubles time and capacity inputs.
fault|公開資料記載軟土至土岩複合及岩層變化，本課研究混合面比例和裂隙如何共同改變掘進反應。~Published ground transitions motivate analysis of mixed-face proportions and fractures that change boring response together.|對齊扭矩波動、地質揭露與出渣粒徑。~Align torque fluctuation, exposures and spoil grading.|把所有扭矩峰當岩石變硬會漏掉面內不均和設備因素。~Treating all torque peaks as harder rock misses face heterogeneity and equipment causes.
water|獅子洋水下地層的水壓教材採分層測壓，不以同一海面水頭代表所有軟硬交界。~Use layered pressure observations rather than assigning one sea-level head to every soft-hard interface.|比較不同層位孔壓與潮位，保留反應延遲。~Compare layer-specific pore pressures and tide with response lag preserved.|低透水層的延遲水壓可能被短時讀值漏掉。~Short observations can miss delayed pressure in low-permeability layers.
tbm|長距離盾構的磨耗與停機需要按軟土、混合面及岩段分類，教材不以單一平均進尺判斷所有區段。~Classify wear and downtime by soft soil, mixed face and rock rather than judging all reaches by one average advance.|逐刀具位置比較磨耗與地層暴露時間。~Compare wear by cutter position and time exposed to each ground type.|平均磨耗可能掩蓋局部刀具先失效造成的非對稱作用。~Mean wear conceals early local cutter failure and asymmetric loading.
grout|高速軌道對沉陷敏感，獅子洋教材把背填幾何空隙與實際地層損失分開，不以注量當沉陷控制證明。~Track geometry is sensitive to settlement; separate annular void from actual ground loss and do not use grout volume alone as proof of control.|結合注壓、注量、環片浮動和地表或孔內位移。~Combine pressure, volume, segment flotation and ground or tunnel movement.|高注量可能伴隨流失，並不能保證軌道支承均勻。~High take may reflect loss and does not ensure uniform track support.
lining|公開技術背景包含不同地層對應結構，本課用薄環示例後指出內襯與縱向構件需另建空間模型。~Different ground-dependent structures require a spatial model for internal lining and longitudinal members beyond a thin-ring example.|比較環向應變、縱向沉陷和軌道基座反應。~Compare hoop strain, longitudinal settlement and track-support response.|只驗環向壓縮會漏掉軟硬交界縱向彎曲。~Hoop compression alone misses longitudinal bending across a stiffness transition.
survey|水下長驅接合需把控制網誤差與盾構姿態分開，獅子洋教材分析相向掘進的方向累積。~Underwater connection requires separation of network error from machine attitude, including direction accumulation in opposing drives.|獨立核對兩端原始角距及接合前探測。~Independently check raw observations from both ends and preconnection surveys.|盾構姿態看似正常可能只是跟隨偏移的導向基準。~Normal machine attitude may merely follow a biased guidance reference.
wave|高速列車的動壓與洞口波形不同，教材以速度平方尺度說明為何還需阻塞比和緩衝結構分析。~Dynamic pressure differs from portal wave shape; velocity-squared scaling explains why blockage and entrance structures still need analysis.|同步量測速度和多位置壓力，辨識反射到達。~Synchronise speed and pressure at several locations to identify reflected arrivals.|直接用動壓預測舒適性會忽略列車與隧道幾何。~Using dynamic pressure alone for comfort ignores train and tunnel geometry.
escape|水下雙孔鐵路的救援需確定列車停車位置和鄰孔狀態，教材將下車流率和步行分開。~Subsea twin-bore rescue depends on stopping position and receiving-bore state; separate detraining flow from walking.|以不同停車點演練門位及可用路徑。~Exercise door positions and usable routes for different stopping points.|最短路徑未必對應所有車廂都能立即進入。~The shortest route may not be immediately accessible from every carriage.
asset|混合地層的結構與軌道維護需要共同里程索引，教材把病害、地質和施工背填資料連結。~Structure and track maintenance across mixed ground need common chainage linking defects, geology and grouting records.|從軌道不平順點回查地層界面與內襯施工批次。~Trace a geometry anomaly to ground transition and lining construction batches.|只修軌道幾何而不查持續地層變形可能反覆返工。~Correcting track alone without investigating continuing ground movement causes repeated work.''')
project('b121','中國~China',37.089,99.003,'32.645 km',2014,'新關角隧道雙線正洞於4月貫通~Both main bores of New Guanjiao Tunnel achieve breakthrough in April','高原施工、斷層變形與長距離物流~Plateau construction, fault deformation and long-distance logistics','中國政府公開記錄新關角隧道32.645公里及2014年4月雙線正洞貫通，這個事件不是通車日期。本課從高原長距離施工出發，研究弱帶支護、地下水、通風密度修正、多工作面物流與控制網。所有空氣密度及機具數字明列為假想條件，不代替高海拔現地測量。~Government records identify New Guanjiao as 32.645 km and both main bores breaking through in April 2014, distinct from opening to traffic. This course studies plateau construction through weak-zone support, water, ventilation-density correction, multi-heading logistics and survey. Air density and equipment values are hypothetical and do not replace high-altitude measurements.','https://www.gov.cn/xinwen/2014-04/15/content_2659690.htm','中國政府公開工程紀錄~China government public project record')
packed('b121','''route|新關角鐵路取代山區繞行的教學比較需固定站間端點，分開隧道時間與全線坡度及接線效益。~A railway realignment comparison fixes station endpoints and separates tunnel time from grade and approach benefits.|用相同停站及速度假設比較路線，不混用直線距離。~Compare routes with equal stopping and speed assumptions, not straight-line distances.|只比較隧道長度無法代表取代展線後的完整服務差。~Tunnel length alone does not represent the full effect of replacing a winding route.
fault|高原弱帶施工的教材用節理填充及破碎程度更新預報，避免把高強度岩塊視為整體穩定。~Update weak-zone forecasts from infill and fragmentation instead of equating strong blocks with stable ground.|將探孔、掌子面和收斂沿同一里程對照。~Compare probes, face maps and convergence along common chainage.|完整試件很強仍可能在軟弱填充帶發生大變形。~Strong intact specimens can coexist with large movement in weak infilled bands.
support|新關角弱帶情境重點是支護變形容量和封閉時序，教材比較硬支護與可容納位移的反應。~The weak-zone scenario focuses on deformation capacity and closure time, comparing stiff support with movement-compatible response.|同步量測支護荷重與收斂速率，標註安裝距離。~Measure support force and convergence rate with installation distance recorded.|只增剛度可能提高受力卻沒有提供必要變形行程。~Added stiffness can raise force without providing the necessary movement capacity.
convergence|長施工區段需比較不同開挖齡期的收斂，教材將平均速率、短時加速和測點重置分開。~Across long work zones, distinguish age-dependent convergence, short acceleration and reset monuments.|保留原始讀值及測點更換日期，核對短時高頻資料。~Retain raw readings and replacement dates and check short-interval data.|重設零點會讓持續變形看似歸零，不能當穩定證據。~Resetting zero makes continuing movement appear absent and is not stability evidence.
water|高原地層補注受季節影響，教材分析凍融或降雨時序與深部裂隙水頭的不同反應。~Seasonal recharge affects plateau ground; distinguish surface thaw or rainfall timing from deep-fracture head response.|比較季節水頭、出流與探孔壓力回復。~Compare seasonal head and inflow with probe-pressure recovery.|表層暫時乾燥不能排除深部持續高水頭。~Temporary surface dryness does not exclude persistent deep head.
ventilation|高海拔空氣密度改變壓損和機械性能，教材所有密度都為假設，不能沿用海平面額定風量作結論。~Altitude changes air density, pressure loss and machine performance; hypothetical density cannot justify copying sea-level ratings into conclusions.|量測現地溫壓及風速，再比較風機實際工況。~Measure local temperature, pressure and velocity before comparing fan operating points.|體積流量相同不代表質量流量和污染稀釋條件完全相同。~Equal volumetric flow does not ensure equal mass flow or dilution conditions.
logistics|長斜井及多工作面的物料循環受高原設備利用率影響，教材把運輸與工作面切削分開排程。~Long accesses and multiple headings couple transport with equipment availability; schedule haulage separately from cutting.|按載重、坡度及等待重建完整往返循環。~Reconstruct round trips using payload, gradient and waiting time.|只用平地車速估循環會低估斜井和卸料占時。~Using level-road speed understates access-gradient and unloading time.
survey|多斜井傳遞控制到深部主孔時，教材研究每條入口網絡誤差是否獨立，不能任意平方和。~Multiple access networks transfer control underground; test independence before combining errors by root-sum-square.|比較各入口原始基準和共同控制點的相關性。~Compare reference origins and correlations among shared control points.|共享基準誤差會在多面網絡一致存在而未被互比發現。~Shared datum error persists across headings and escapes mutual comparison.
rail|高原列車坡度功率教材只計重力分量，另列空氣密度、車輛性能和營運規則需求。~The plateau traction exercise calculates only gravity demand while retaining separate density, vehicle-performance and operating-rule needs.|核對質量、坡度單位和速度，將其他阻力另表。~Check mass, grade units and speed and list other resistance separately.|低空氣密度不會減少列車重力坡度阻力。~Lower air density does not reduce gravitational grade resistance.
asset|長距離多工區資料交付需把斜井里程轉成主孔統一索引，教材研究同名測點的識別問題。~Long multi-lot handover converts access chainages into main-bore indexing and resolves similarly named monitoring points.|抽查測點可追到主孔位置、安裝時間和校正紀錄。~Trace monitoring points to main-bore location, installation time and calibration.|斜井里程未轉換會把異常收斂定位到錯誤地質區。~Unconverted access chainage places abnormal convergence in the wrong ground domain.''')
project('b122','中國~China',33.875,108.992,'18.02 km single-bore route',2007,'秦嶺終南山公路隧道於1月20日開通~Qinling Zhongnanshan Highway Tunnel opens on 20 January','長道路視覺、豎井通風與山體地質~Long-road vision, shaft ventilation and mountain geology','陝西交通官方年鑑附錄記錄秦嶺終南山公路隧道18.02公里及2007年1月20日通車。本課將長公路的視覺環境、豎井風路、岩體應力、水壓及設備可靠度整合，要求學員區分舒適感與可量測的障礙辨識。教學通風與照明參數不聲稱是本工程的營運設定。~The Shaanxi transport yearbook appendix records an 18.02 km tunnel and opening on 20 January 2007. This course integrates visual environment, shaft airflow, rock stress, water pressure and reliability, distinguishing perceived comfort from measurable obstacle detection. Teaching ventilation and lighting parameters are not represented as the project operating settings.','https://jtyst.shaanxi.gov.cn/static/home/nianjian/2018/13.pdf','陝西省交通運輸廳~Shaanxi Department of Transport')
packed('b122','''route|終南山兩孔的土建總長與單趟行車長度不同，教材比較穿山服務時保留兩端引道和坡度。~Twin-bore construction length differs from one journey; retain approaches and gradients when comparing the mountain crossing.|核對長度是否單孔中心線或雙孔工程量。~Check whether length denotes one centreline or combined bore quantities.|以雙孔總長算行程會使旅行時間成倍錯誤。~Using combined bore length multiplies journey time incorrectly.
stress|秦嶺山體的覆土和節理提供不同破壞機制，教材以彈性峰值作尺度，再辨認剝落或弱帶變形。~Cover and joints produce different failure mechanisms; use elastic peaks for scale before distinguishing spalling from weak-zone movement.|將破壞方位、岩石試驗與多點位移對照。~Compare damage orientation, rock tests and multipoint displacement.|覆土最大位置不必然是所有類型變形最嚴重位置。~Maximum cover need not coincide with every type of maximum deformation.
fault|長路線需要持續更新破碎帶模型，終南山教材研究探孔未命中與真實無弱帶的差別。~Long alignments need continuing fault-model updates; distinguish a missed structure from genuine absence of weak ground.|保留探孔方向及未覆蓋體積，對照揭露地質。~Retain probe orientation and unsampled volume against exposed geology.|無異常讀值若來自錯過構造，不能提高整段穩定信心。~No anomaly from a missed structure cannot justify confidence in the whole reach.
water|洞內排水與山體含水層互相影響，教材檢查支路封閉或泵停後外壓回升情境。~Drainage interacts with mountain aquifers; assess head recovery after branch closure or pump outage.|以分層測壓和排水流量檢查回復時間尺度。~Use layered pressure and flow to examine recovery time scales.|正常排水水頭低不代表堵塞後也維持同一壓力。~Low drained head does not establish the same pressure after blockage.
ventilation|長道路豎井與水平風道形成網路，教材將支路阻力、外風與風機工況一起求解。~Shafts and horizontal ducts form a network requiring branch resistance, external wind and fan operating points to be considered together.|同時量測井口、風道和道路區的壓差與風速。~Measure shaft, duct and roadway pressure and velocity simultaneously.|井口風量大可能只是支路短路，未必改善遠端道路區。~High shaft flow may reflect a shortcut rather than improved distant roadway ventilation.
lighting|終南山長距離行車的視覺變化可作人因研究背景，教材將景觀亮度與道路障礙對比分開量測。~Visual variation provides a human-factors setting, but decorative brightness and road-obstacle contrast require separate measurements.|從實際駕駛視角比較不同背景下相同障礙的可見性。~Compare the same obstacle under different backgrounds from the driving viewpoint.|景觀明亮不保證路面反光或眩光不妨礙辨識。~Bright decoration does not exclude glare or reflections that hinder detection.
support|洞室擴大或通風連接會改變局部支護路徑，教材不把一般斷面支護直接套到交會部。~Enlargements and ventilation connections alter support paths; do not copy ordinary-section support into junctions.|將交會部收斂和支護荷重與一般區分開比較。~Compare junction convergence and support force separately from ordinary reaches.|交會部三維釋放可能使相同材料支護承受不同作用。~Three-dimensional release at junctions changes actions despite identical support material.
escape|長道路撤離需要保留反應、步行和接收區狀態，教材研究不同事故里程的路徑差異。~Evacuation includes response, walking and receiving-area state; compare routes for different incident chainages.|按事故位置重新核對標示可見性和橫通道可用性。~Recheck sign visibility and passage availability by incident location.|只用隧道中央一種情境會漏掉入口或交會區的限制。~One central scenario misses constraints near portals or junctions.
reliability|風機、感測器與控制器共用供電時，設備數量不能直接當冗餘，教材分開共同失效與單機失效。~Shared power among fans, sensors and controllers means equipment count is not redundancy; distinguish common and individual failures.|追查供電、通訊與冷卻共同節點，再作隔離測試。~Trace common power, communication and cooling nodes before isolation tests.|兩套感測器失去共同時鐘後可能同時產生錯誤控制資訊。~Two sensors can simultaneously mislead controls after losing a shared clock.
asset|長隧道設備位置重複，教材要求機房、孔別、里程和樓層欄位共同定位維修任務。~Repeated equipment along a long tunnel requires plant room, bore, chainage and level to locate maintenance work uniquely.|抽查告警到現場標籤和測試紀錄的對應。~Sample alarm-to-field-label and test-record correspondence.|只有設備名稱沒有位置層級會使維修資料無法可靠使用。~An asset name without location hierarchy cannot reliably guide maintenance.''')
project('b123','挪威~Norway',59.023,5.866,'14.4 km',2019,'里菲爾克隧道於12月30日開放通車~Ryfylke Tunnel opens to traffic on 30 December','深海低點、水壓與抽排韌性~Deep subsea low point, water pressure and drainage resilience','挪威公路管理局2019年開通紀錄列里菲爾克隧道14.4公里、最低點在海面下292公尺。本課把幾何深度與測壓水頭分開，再研究裂隙封水、支護、低點集水、供電、坡道行車與跨孔撤離；不把海面下深度直接當成所有岩體孔壓或襯砌設計壓力。~The Norwegian road authority records Ryfylke opening in 2019, at 14.4 km with a low point 292 m below sea level. This course distinguishes geometric depth from piezometric head, then examines fracture sealing, support, low-point drainage, power, road gradients and cross-bore evacuation without treating depth as universal pore or lining pressure.','https://www.vegvesen.no/om-oss/presse/aktuelt/nasjonalt/verdens-lengste-og-dypeste-veitunnel-er-apnet/','挪威公路管理局~Norwegian Public Roads Administration')
packed('b123','''route|里菲爾克深海低點使路線包含長坡，教材比較同端點行程時另列坡度及車輛差異。~The deep low point creates long grades; compare travel between equal endpoints while separately retaining slope and vehicle differences.|把縱斷面低點和車速假設標在路線圖。~Mark the low point and assumed speed on the longitudinal route.|同長度平路時間不能代表長坡重車實際行程。~Equal-length level-road time does not represent heavy vehicles on long grades.
water|海下292公尺是公開幾何位置，本課壓力模型另用假想測壓水頭，避免把兩者無條件相等。~The published 292 m depth is geometry; the pressure model uses a separate hypothetical head rather than equating them automatically.|以裂隙連通、孔壓和潮位資料檢查水頭邊界。~Check head boundaries using connectivity, pressure and tide data.|幾何深度不能單獨證明排水後每個位置的實際外壓。~Depth alone cannot establish drained external pressure at every location.
fault|海底岩盤裂隙可形成集中補注，教材研究先進孔出水衰減與持續海水連通的不同解釋。~Subsea fractures can focus recharge; distinguish probe-flow decay from evidence of continuing sea connection.|比較壓力回復、鹽度與流量時序而非只看瞬間水量。~Compare recovery, salinity and flow histories rather than one instantaneous rate.|暫時衰減可能是孔內儲水釋放，不能當補注切斷。~Temporary decline may be local storage release rather than disconnected recharge.
grout|里菲爾克假想封水試段需用注前後水理證據檢查效果，注量大不等於裂隙全被填滿。~A hypothetical sealing trial needs before-and-after hydraulic evidence; high take does not mean every fracture is filled.|比較同壓試驗及鄰孔反應，保留材料凝結條件。~Compare equal-pressure tests and neighbouring responses with setting conditions recorded.|遠端流失可能讓近區試段仍有未封閉的主水路。~Distant grout loss can leave the dominant local water path open.
support|深海孔的岩體支護與防水功能分開，教材研究節理塊體穩定而仍有高滲流的情境。~Separate rock support from waterproofing; stable joint blocks can coexist with significant seepage.|把塊體位移、錨固荷重與流量各自量測。~Measure block movement, anchor force and flow separately.|位移小不能當作封水成功，也不能由漏水推定支護失效。~Small movement does not prove sealing, and leakage alone does not prove support failure.
lining|防水襯砌和噴覆支護的作用需依斷面釐清，教材薄環式僅對假想連續圓形襯砌適用。~Clarify waterproof lining and sprayed-support functions; the thin-ring exercise applies only to a hypothetical continuous circular lining.|核對實際結構型式後再決定是否可用環向模型。~Check structural form before deciding whether a hoop model applies.|把非連續防水系統當完整承壓環會虛構受力路徑。~Treating a discontinuous waterproof system as a pressure ring invents a load path.
drain|深低點集水需保留持續入流和停電條件，里菲爾克教材計算緩衝時間後另驗泵揚程。~Low-point sumps need continuing inflow and power-loss cases; calculate buffer time and separately verify pump head.|用實測泵流量、出水水頭與集水位上升率互查。~Cross-check pump delivery, discharge head and sump rise rate.|名目泵流量在高揚程下可能無法實現，緩衝會提早耗盡。~Nominal pump delivery may be unattainable at high head, exhausting reserve early.
reliability|深低點抽排的兩泵若共享電源及出口管路，教材不把單機不可用率直接平方當全系統風險。~Two sump pumps sharing power and discharge lines do not justify squaring unit unavailability for the whole system.|追查電源、止回和共用管路故障的影響。~Trace effects of power, check-valve and common-pipe failures.|共用出口堵塞會讓兩台正常泵都無法排水。~A blocked common outlet prevents both healthy pumps from discharging.
ventilation|長下坡與上坡車流改變污染源和活塞作用，教材用網路量測辨識風機與車流的相對影響。~Descending and climbing traffic change emissions and piston effects; use network observations to distinguish traffic from fan influence.|同時記錄方向車流、風速和壓差，不混用不同時段。~Record directional traffic, velocity and pressure simultaneously.|交通方向變化引起的風流不應直接判為風機性能衰退。~Traffic-induced flow changes should not be labelled fan deterioration directly.
escape|深海路線兩端爬升距離長，跨孔路徑與最終出口需求不同，教材分階段計算並檢查鄰孔狀態。~Long ascent to portals makes cross-bore transfer distinct from reaching an ultimate exit; calculate stages and check the receiving bore.|核對轉入鄰孔後的交通控制及後續移動方案。~Check traffic control and onward movement after transfer to the adjacent bore.|到達鄰孔不等於完成所有人員的最終撤離。~Arrival in the adjacent bore does not complete final evacuation for everyone.''')
project('b124','日本~Japan',35.998,139.811,'6.3 km underground waterway',2002,'第3立坑至泵站3.3公里區間於6月先行運用~The 3.3 km reach from shaft 3 to the pumping station begins interim use in June','洪水調蓄、跌水豎井與水位控制~Flood storage, drop shafts and level control','首都圈外郭放水路由入流設施、地下水路、調壓水槽與泵站共同減少洪水影響，官方圖列水路6.3公里。2002年先行運用的是部分3.3公里區間，工程期至2006年。本課以水量、能量及水位基準串接全系統，避免把地下河道誤當道路隧道或將局部算例當完整洪水演算。~The Metropolitan Area Outer Underground Discharge Channel combines intakes, a 6.3 km underground waterway, a pressure-control tank and pumps. Interim use in 2002 covered a 3.3 km portion; construction continued to 2006. This course connects water balance, energy and level datum without treating the facility as a road or a local calculation as full flood routing.','https://www.ktr.mlit.go.jp/edogawa/study/sora/gaikaku/detail/zentai04.html','日本國土交通省江戶川河川事務所~MLIT Edogawa River Office')
packed('b124','''waterroute|首都圈放水路收集多河川入流，教材以水體平流時間辨認路徑，明確區別洪峰波速與控制延遲。~The channel receives several rivers; use material advection to identify a route while distinguishing flood-wave celerity and control delay.|對齊各支路和出口的流量水位時序。~Align branch and outlet flow-level histories.|用交通速度或單一平流時間預測洪峰都會失去水理意義。~Vehicle speed or one advection time cannot predict flood-peak routing.
storage|調蓄量由入出流歷線積分決定，教材研究下游高水位限制排放時的庫容消耗。~Storage follows integrated inflow minus outflow; examine reserve depletion when downstream high water limits discharge.|閉合水位庫容和逐時流量帳，保留初始蓄水。~Close level-volume and time-step flow balances with initial storage retained.|假設設施全空且泵始終滿流會低估最高水位。~Assuming empty storage and full pumping throughout understates maximum level.
hydraulic|地下水路的摩阻算例限穩態滿管，教材另外辨認自由水面、回水和局部收縮可能改變流況。~The friction example is steady and full-pipe; identify free surfaces, backwater and contractions that can change the flow regime.|以同步水位和流量辨認滿管及非滿管狀態。~Use simultaneous levels and flow to distinguish pressurised and free-surface states.|在非滿管時套滿管直徑會得到無物理邊界的損失。~Using full-pipe geometry in free-surface flow gives an inapplicable loss estimate.
shaftflow|入流豎井把高程能轉成紊流和壓力，教材算位能通量而不是提升機功率或井壁均壓。~Inlet shafts convert elevation energy into turbulence and pressure; calculate potential-energy flux rather than hoist power or uniform wall pressure.|同步量測跌水流量、氣壓和局部壓力脈動。~Synchronise drop flow, air pressure and local pressure fluctuations.|平均功率不能直接推出井壁最大衝擊壓。~Mean power cannot directly yield peak wall impact pressure.
roof|調壓大廳頂板經柱網傳力，教材條帶彎矩不取代整體框架、柱頭沖切和底板抗浮。~The pressure-control hall roof transfers load through columns; strip bending does not replace global, punching or flotation checks.|核對柱網、回填、板撓度與柱軸力。~Check column layout, backfill, slab deflection and column force.|頂板均載模型不能用來宣稱整個大廳抗浮穩定。~A uniformly loaded roof model cannot establish flotation stability of the hall.
water|地下水位與內部洪水位可分別變動，教材將放空時外壓和充水時淨內壓分開。~Groundwater and internal flood level vary independently; distinguish external pressure when empty from net internal pressure when filled.|將兩側水位換成共同高程和表壓後比較。~Convert both sides to common elevation and gauge pressure before comparison.|只看內水位會漏掉空槽時外部地下水控制作用。~Internal level alone misses groundwater control when the tank is empty.
lining|圓形地下水路的外壓與內壓方向不同，教材均勻環向量級需要按每個水位階段改變淨壓。~External and internal pressures act oppositely on the circular waterway; update net pressure by water-level stage.|比較環形變形與內外水位，而非僅單側壓力。~Compare ring distortion with both water levels, not one-sided pressure alone.|忽略放空後外壓回升會低估外壓主導階段。~Omitting external-head recovery after draining understates the external-pressure stage.
levelvolume|控制系統把水位轉成剩餘庫容，教材研究共同零點偏移如何讓多感測器一致卻錯估餘量。~Controls convert level to reserve volume; examine a shared zero bias that makes sensors agree while misestimating capacity.|以獨立水準和人工水尺核對零點及庫容表。~Check zero and volume tables against independent levelling and a staff gauge.|多支同基準感測器不能互相排除共同高程錯誤。~Sensors sharing one reference cannot eliminate a common elevation error by agreement.
reliability|防洪泵組可用性還取決於供電、出口水頭和共用設備，教材獨立並聯式只作下限模型。~Flood-pump availability also depends on power, discharge head and shared assets; the independent-parallel equation is only a restricted model.|追查每泵供電、閘門和共同出水路徑。~Trace each pump feed, gate and shared discharge route.|兩泵正常仍可能因同一高下游水位無法達名目出流。~Two healthy pumps may fail to achieve rated flow against the same high tailwater.
asset|洪水事件紀錄需連接雨量、閘門、水位和泵站狀態，教材以事件時間軸檢查資料完整與可追溯性。~Flood records must link rainfall, gates, levels and pump state; use an event timeline to check completeness and traceability.|從一次水位峰回查所有感測器時間與校正版本。~Trace one level peak through sensor timestamps and calibration revisions.|時鐘錯位會把泵啟動先後顛倒，造成錯誤控制評估。~Clock offsets reverse apparent pump timing and distort control evaluation.''')
eventsource('b124','https://www.ktr.mlit.go.jp/edogawa/edogawa00147.html','MLIT Edogawa River Office')
project('b125','新加坡~Singapore',1.270,103.690,'1.47 million m³ storage capacity',2014,'裕廊岩洞儲存設施於9月正式開幕~Jurong Rock Caverns storage facility officially opens in September','岩洞楔體、水力封存與產品庫存~Cavern wedges, hydraulic containment and product inventory','JTC公開介紹裕廊岩洞可儲存147萬立方公尺液態碳氫產品，並將地下深度與海床下深度分開；2014年開幕有總理公署紀錄。本課從土地介面、岩體節理與支護開始，進入水力封存、產品庫存及監測交付。幾何面積、局部壓差和假想庫存都不等於實際土地效益或操作上限。~JTC describes 1.47 million cubic metres of liquid-hydrocarbon storage and distinguishes depth below ground from depth beneath the seabed; the PMO records the 2014 opening. The course moves from land interfaces and jointed rock to support, hydraulic containment, inventory and monitoring. Geometric area, local pressure difference and hypothetical inventory are not actual land savings or operating limits.','https://www.jtc.gov.sg/find-space/jurong-rock-caverns','新加坡裕廊集團~JTC Singapore')
packed('b125','''landuse|裕廊以地下儲存重新配置地面用途，教材容積除高度只算假想幾何面積，不重述為實際節省土地。~Jurong reallocates surface use through underground storage; volume divided by height gives a hypothetical geometric area, not actual land released.|總配置另列豎井、管線、消防及地面製程空間。~The overall layout separately includes shafts, pipelines, firefighting and surface processing.|只算洞室投影會漏掉支援營運必需的地面設施。~Cavern projection alone omits surface facilities needed for operation.
cavern|裕廊大跨洞室的局部楔體由節理交線控制，教材自重均分不代表所有錨桿實際同時受力。~Joint intersections control local wedges in wide caverns; equal weight sharing does not imply simultaneous equal anchor loading.|以三維節理測繪及錨固試驗確認滑移方向和有效長度。~Use three-dimensional mapping and anchor tests to check sliding direction and effective length.|錨桿穿過塊體但未超出滑面可能無法提供預期拘束。~An anchor that does not extend beyond the release surface cannot provide expected restraint.
stress|洞室群互相影響岩柱和洞頂應力，教材圓孔彈性解只是量級，不能取代非圓大跨群洞模型。~Cavern groups interact through pillars and roofs; a circular-hole elastic solution is only a scale estimate, not a wide noncircular group model.|比較洞頂與岩柱位移方向，核對原位應力比。~Compare roof and pillar movement directions with in-situ stress ratio.|把每洞視為孤立圓孔會漏掉岩柱荷載重分配。~Treating each cavern as an isolated circle omits pillar load redistribution.
support|大跨岩洞支護需隨分層開挖啟動，教材將洞頂先期支護和側壁後續釋放分開。~Support activates during staged cavern excavation; distinguish early roof support from later sidewall release.|將各層開挖時間、錨荷重及伸長量同步記錄。~Synchronise excavation stages, anchor loads and extension measurements.|早期洞頂穩定不能證明後續下挖不會改變其受力。~Early roof stability does not establish unchanged loads during subsequent benching.
water|周圍地下水是儲存封存分析的重要邊界，裕廊教材區分施工降水與儲存期間所需水頭。~Surrounding groundwater is a containment boundary; distinguish construction dewatering from heads needed during storage.|比較停抽後水頭回復與多位置測壓分布。~Compare recovery after pumping stops with spatial head distribution.|施工期越乾燥不代表儲存期封存條件越好。~Drier construction conditions do not necessarily improve storage containment.
containment|產品液柱與氣相表壓共同決定洞壁內壓，教材全部壓力換算至同一高程再判斷局部向內梯度。~Product head and gas gauge pressure jointly determine internal pressure; convert all terms to one elevation before judging a local inward gradient.|同時核對外水頭、產品液位、密度和氣相壓力。~Check external head, product level, density and gas pressure simultaneously.|漏掉氣相壓力會高估封存餘量，單點正值也不能證明全洞。~Omitted gas pressure overstates margin, and one positive point cannot prove whole-cavern containment.
inventory|裕廊是產品儲存而非洪水調蓄，教材扣除既有庫存與保留空間，另區分同溫體積帳與質量帳。~Jurong stores product rather than floods; subtract stock and reserve while distinguishing same-temperature volume from mass accounting.|配對液位容積表、溫度和密度，另列管線存量。~Pair level-volume tables, temperature and density and list pipeline inventory separately.|把總幾何容積當可立即裝填量會漏掉氣相及保留空間。~Gross geometry as immediate filling capacity omits vapour and reserved space.
survey|洞室與地面設備的共同高程直接影響靜壓比較，教材研究深部水準基準偏移的封存後果。~A shared elevation datum between cavern and surface equipment directly affects pressure comparison; examine consequences of deep benchmark bias.|以獨立水準路線核對液位與測壓管口高程。~Independently level liquid references and piezometer collars.|同一高程錯誤可能讓液位和水頭各自合理但壓差算錯。~One datum error can make separate levels plausible while the pressure difference is wrong.
environment|儲存岩洞周圍水量帳需分開補注、滲入和產品管線範圍，教材不以水量殘差直接宣稱產品洩漏。~Separate recharge, water ingress and product-pipeline boundaries; a water-balance residual is not direct proof of product leakage.|以水位、水量與獨立品質檢測交叉判讀，保留缺測。~Combine level, flow and independent quality evidence while preserving data gaps.|未量測的地下水支路可能造成殘差，不能單憑差額定因。~Unmeasured groundwater branches create residuals that cannot alone identify cause.
asset|產品儲存設備與岩體監測必須連接位置及狀態，教材把產品庫存表、測壓和支護檢查放在同一可追溯鏈。~Link product-system records and rock monitoring by location and state, connecting inventory, pressure and support inspections traceably.|抽查某洞室異常可否回查操作狀態、感測校正和地質。~Trace a cavern anomaly to operating state, sensor calibration and geology.|只看單一儀表趨勢而缺操作狀態會把正常轉運當異常滲流。~One instrument trend without operating context can misclassify normal transfer as abnormal seepage.''')
eventsource('b125','https://www.pmo.gov.sg/newsroom/transcript-prime-minister-lee-hsien-loongs-speech-official-opening-jurong-rock-caverns/','Prime Minister Office Singapore')
for cid in ('b106','b123'):
 B[cid]=[('fracturegrout',*r[1:]) if r[0]=='grout' else r for r in B[cid]]
